I\n\nRemove all OpenClaw CLI/gateway integration code. Task dispatch and Aegis\nreviews now go exclusively through the Anthropic Messages API. Gateway\nfeatures (sessions, channels, nodes) are stubbed to throw so the app\ncompiles but won''t route through OpenClaw at runtime.\n\nDeleted: openclaw-gateway.ts, openclaw-doctor.ts, openclaw-doctor-fix.ts,\nadapters/openclaw.ts, /api/openclaw/* routes, update/doctor banners.\n\nCleaned: config.ts (removed 20+ OPENCLAW_* env vars), command.ts\n(removed runOpenClaw/runClawdbot), task-dispatch.ts (removed gateway\ndispatch paths), agent-runtimes.ts (removed openclaw runtime), store\n(removed openclaw UI state).\n\nAll 855 tests pass. TSC clean (only pre-existing recharts type issue).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3470b9d4e36261b3113629bed1790ac65dc8f2bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jake-qp/mission-control/git/trees/3470b9d4e36261b3113629bed1790ac65dc8f2bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jake-qp/mission-control/git/commits/7ffeb43f2eed8b98d8d93e80a0e8abe05ad1d141","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53414466?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jake-qp","id":53414466,"login":"Jake-qp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNDE0NDY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jake-qp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https