I\n- Removed inline 100+ endpoint API docs (use /api-docs Scalar UI)\n- Removed completed roadmap items (belong in CHANGELOG)\n- Consolidated duplicate feature descriptions\n- Reduced from 707 lines to 345 lines — same content, half the noise","tree":{"sha":"2a2d439c338ad9fedf5e57ef0e2048a9472c238c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jake-qp/mission-control/git/trees/2a2d439c338ad9fedf5e57ef0e2048a9472c238c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jake-qp/mission-control/git/commits/f3192a93016b77369f03fd23f8f1e37433e06a63","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a2d439c338ad9fedf5e57ef0e2048a9472c238c\nparent 648347cab75cd5232fafeba43bb723de62773b4c\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774246418 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774246418 +0700\n\ndocs: restructure README with best-practice patterns (#484)\n\nApply hermes-agent README best practices:\n- Feature table (HTML <table>) at top for 10-second scan\n- Clear \"after installation\" moment (2 lines, not a wall)\n- Documentation table with \"What You''ll Learn\" column\n- API reference collapsed into summary table + link to OpenAPI\n- Removed inline 100+ endpoint API docs (use /api-docs Scalar UI)\n- Removed completed roadmap items (belong in CHANGELOG)\n- Consolidated duplicate feature descriptions\n- Reduced from 707 lines to 345 lines — same content, half the noise","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwNoSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADzIQADYovE6aiXvnlXqEoiJjIbQI\nLKsfUQSiV+dvYw8gsljNnXCCc+6PNf1hDdZMq0VV0usZ1kfLOxHeZHkIxyqXtONa\nqZbl9fqDbMSCsglEmHG12AKgU+uf/nq+O4Re+WKWv5c5F+i+t91I0aUoMIKF4ok3\nvDsRzDhGWli8XvDv3LDwXa0JVpXnxO7ATvd1gZ1XDHPJehF8Vn5S1aKgKUdOj4lu\nVqURbdW4t+EnY12O4fY3LhCQoLXyzpd2BYQKvAZJ0VsZ0MIDjaIpIa9digOVFRXk\n0t3MFBZqN5SyDZPbEVHyEAAUT0ECV1vfK6AhgxNb9OXMTjB+Ftd5hngobTJf7UBF\nm5KGnFHZAMlta08VpDPh8X95ZpjoiAnlWDyzEPnYwCids6k9nYGaml6bAknCMMbd\njC8mQitb/OxQPDR9NuXXMufZkCH6hCy7y2z+n7C3n0FrXHy+pTY6pahEGmVN1LVk\nBUN0//wHBGYyvgopq09ZsyvynAxnor0SLhGJYz1B4