ill receive heartbeats and exist in the DB — they are\npurely hidden from the default UI view.\n\n- Migration 042: adds `hidden` column to agents table\n- API: POST/DELETE /api/agents/[id]/hide to toggle visibility\n- GET /api/agents filters hidden by default, ?show_hidden=true to include\n- UI: \"Show hidden\" toggle in panel header, Hide/Unhide button on cards\n\nCo-authored-by: Dan <github@bookkept.com.au>","tree":{"sha":"c1938ea1c55860688b659f77eb06b0913c6fc94f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jake-qp/mission-control/git/trees/c1938ea1c55860688b659f77eb06b0913c6fc94f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jake-qp/mission-control/git/commits/f872aac504de5143790b612498801df26b4a13a4","verification":{"payload":"tree c1938ea1c55860688b659f77eb06b0913c6fc94f\nparent 51a51a0ba2462bb2b028d1fe7100739a0c17ae72\nauthor danielaustralia1 <40316131+danielaustralia1@users.noreply.github.com> 1773928105 +1100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773928105 +0700\n\nfeat: add hide/unhide agents from UI (#453)\n\nAdd ability to hide agents from the dashboard without deleting them.\nHidden agents still receive heartbeats and exist in the DB — they are\npurely hidden from the default UI view.\n\n- Migration 042: adds `hidden` column to agents table\n- API: POST/DELETE /api/agents/[id]/hide to toggle visibility\n- GET /api/agents filters hidden by default, ?show_hidden=true to include\n- UI: \"Show hidden\" toggle in panel header, Hide/Unhide button on cards\n\nCo-authored-by: Dan <github@bookkept.com.au>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpu/6pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAga4QAK9IrdTZ05W37ZYN2o9UoPyB\nwiOCHI8fPsZ5HGMcVp0cvo1HdiloQC/T/J7dXG9WG5nWWZgF8FHyVCUgVPQxOnz8\n8tY5sh5j8H4U0XzRv3sbP+o9PtwC1IgE/pKFDitCiLToHQ/mLE52z5KRCfaoqiJ5\nt1phlf/m17ROkrTqPJ7fs6Q9GAIrMmd2UO0wN5XkN+LIkctIAfDeIpzTwx/daJad\nkecZHJ3fauAyCMDGn8/vtMJCpsZiyzH78p+TMhL9FlSiAKqDbaTnH/v97GyndX7a\nZx6eeri/GA85Afn2llKGL/7k6Fo41XTVnqtZpME7U/DhkoLWWlZu1VPHUbmXJrAi\n6y7gfvS+CIPAqfGC5rI9