/3c798743712e0d20c21bf96e0afa8115ee956fdb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:00:21Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:00:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(schema): shrink snapshot metadata ledger to object-only PascalCase core (#103)\n\nReduce the opt-in metadata ledger to a single ChuckObjectMetadata table with\nfixed PascalCase column names (Owner, ObjectType, ObjectSchema, ObjectName,\nFirstAppliedAtUtc, LastAppliedAtUtc, LastChangedAtUtc, DefinitionHash). Drop\nthe chuck_database_metadata table and the SourceRepo / SourceRev / ToolVersion\nprovenance fields; richer or app-specific provenance belongs in caller-owned\nsibling tables outside chuck.\n\nBypass dialect NormalizeIdentifier for the ledger table so the PascalCase\nidentifier renders verbatim on Postgres (which would otherwise camelToSnake\nthe table name). Ownership-notice pointer text and tests/docs updated to\nmatch.","tree":{"sha":"9269002908668c4feabc28aa970f86af71fc80d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/9269002908668c4feabc28aa970f86af71fc80d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/3c798743712e0d20c21bf96e0afa8115ee956fdb","verification":{"payload":"tree 9269002908668c4feabc28aa970f86af71fc80d7\nparent b420043f09862407793ed48cb5a8291532f43a3d\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1779368421 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779368421 -0500\n\nrefactor(schema): shrink snapshot metadata ledger to object-only PascalCase core (#103)\n\nReduce the opt-in metadata ledger to a single ChuckObjectMetadata table with\nfixed PascalCase column names (Owner, ObjectType, ObjectSchema, ObjectName,\nFirstAppliedAtUtc, LastAppliedAtUtc, LastChangedAtUtc, DefinitionHash). Drop\nthe chuck_database_metadata table and the SourceRepo / SourceRev / ToolVersion\nprovenance fields; richer or app-specific provenance belongs in caller-owned\nsibling tables outside chuck.\n\nBypass dialect NormalizeIdentifier for the ledger table so the PascalCase\nidentifier renders verbatim on Postgres (which would otherwise camelToSnake\nthe table name). Ownership-notice pointer text and tests/docs updated to\nmatch.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDwHlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeAoQAAFvNpmbKlM0NOGYd4H4TUId\nieYu4DELL2ed0lsrc7zU5y/Mn/4pE0BXvlphdP3Pj1xuxd2tepvgDZzhT6PhxSm8\nlzAqm85AdYzf/Gb+4ZYuGYflGm4AaiJ2O3TNSPPBLDsveFSLUy0nh29E3pgPTf5K\nFSTuRi6UByY1G2AOX1fcARH+oJkwxH1UG9f52Xy+ownKO/BGeF7R1z9Qy0BHTz7K\neoJp2jZ2OXwWIja19+BZCWJaZ6GR008nr3h76X1DgH/tJGFSEciwKWL/o1bd8yuv\naY2jQTIhPoGWqYjm5q29tBQ5wzIHs26D3EH4u90nQEYJUuVeVlSxI0cZWQ6lEZo7\n+NaPhCqwgW2o9NEAMV1epJi6/rT9JzAj6w5qGI22NKxYjumJyteb8Om1gn68+5Cp\n76F8D8TM2hUEPjEO2xwdD+GLdTEBlCF3qBokN/Ge6PVjMnY+GIZubGezJ+MsYKXt\nOzVgG29o5Ee6dkA6RnpWuSVP8yZ4NC9CMcF7oHlbD4vSK1yOumw4IYSchR7BOF2Y\n+OBqY15rc+qx5M9oXUGvLMUeyZY/ShWOpzt7f6+GAMnnUD5JH+FJiN/MSJtib2J9\nQAcCVttMswVJ6gK8ycOe4lqdTy+GZKRtM7OUf+9ZBTVNXuZJQC6HR79KYhxJ8SMY\n5HvhdkrFeLEvajpDrXBo\n=VLQT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T13:00:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/3c798743712e0d20c21bf96e0afa8115ee956fdb","node_id":"C_kwDOR4JmSdoAKDNjNzk4NzQzNzEyZTBkMjBjMjFiZjk2ZTBhZmE4MTE1ZWU5NTZmZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/b420043f09862407793ed48cb5a8291532f43a3d","sha":"b420043f09862407793ed48cb5a8291532f43a3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/b420043f09862407793ed48cb5a8291532f43a3d"}],"sha":"3c798743712e0d20c21bf96e0afa8115ee956fdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/3c798743712e0d20c21bf96e0afa8115ee956fdb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/b420043f09862407793ed48cb5a8291532f43a3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T12:07:44Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T12:07:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(schema): owned code-object notice points at metadata ledger when enabled (#101)\n\nWhen CodeObjectOptions.OwnershipNotice renders and CodeObjectOptions.Metadata\nis non-nil, the rendered chuck-owned block comment now carries a single-line\n\"Provenance recorded in <table>.\" pointer at the bottom of the notice text.\nThe pointer names the dialect-quoted, schema-qualified chuck_object_metadata\ntable so a DB reader inspecting the live view/procedure can jump directly to\nthe ledger row that records this object''s provenance.\n\nThe augmentation is opt-in and honest:\n\n- never added when OwnershipNotice is empty (metadata alone does not invent\n  a fresh ownership block)\n- never added when Metadata is nil (no pointer when no ledger exists)\n- never includes runtime-churn data (no timestamps in generated SQL)\n\nThe strict configured-prefix strip used by Validate*WithOptions also sees the\naugmented notice, so apply and validate stay symmetric on the strict path\nwhile leading-comment-only changes remain drift-insensitive via the broader\ncanonicalisation strip.\n\nDefaultOwnershipNotice constant is unchanged — the pointer is composed at\nrender time from MetadataConfig + dialect, never baked into the constant.\n\nSQLite end-to-end integration coverage plus per-dialect unit tests\n(metadataNoticePointer for SQLite/Postgres/MSSQL with and without an\nexplicit ledger schema; effectiveOptionsForRender for all four\nnotice/metadata permutations).","tree":{"sha":"ccad00a3bf6d59e7512ae9b0c3577502443b828a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/ccad00a3bf6d59e7512ae9b0c3577502443b828a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/b420043f09862407793ed48cb5a8291532f43a3d","verification":{"payload":"tree ccad00a3bf6d59e7512ae9b0c3577502443b828a\nparent 463c25e822d8b52e201012f4359609b311ca6bac\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1779365264 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779365264 -0500\n\nfeat(schema): owned code-object notice points at metadata ledger when enabled (#101)\n\nWhen CodeObjectOptions.OwnershipNotice renders and CodeObjectOptions.Metadata\nis non-nil, the rendered chuck-owned block comment now carries a single-line\n\"Provenance recorded in <table>.\" pointer at the bottom of the notice text.\nThe pointer names the dialect-quoted, schema-qualified chuck_object_metadata\ntable so a DB reader inspecting the live view/procedure can jump directly to\nthe ledger row that records this object''s provenance.\n\nThe augmentation is opt-in and honest:\n\n- never added when OwnershipNotice is empty (metadata alone does not invent\n  a fresh ownership block)\n- never added when Metadata is nil (no pointer when no ledger exists)\n- never includes runtime-churn data (no timestamps in generated SQL)\n\nThe strict configured-prefix strip used by Validate*WithOptions also sees the\naugmented notice, so apply and validate stay symmetric on the strict path\nwhile leading-comment-only changes remain drift-insensitive via the broader\ncanonicalisation strip.\n\nDefaultOwnershipNotice constant is unchanged — the pointer is composed at\nrender time from MetadataConfig + dialect, never baked into the constant.\n\nSQLite end-to-end integration coverage plus per-dialect unit tests\n(metadataNoticePointer for SQLite/Postgres/MSSQL with and without an\nexplicit ledger schema; effectiveOptionsForRender for all four\nnotice/metadata permutations).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDvWQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAANkQAFmVccCUQGEucOIc4VoblcZj\naKPbms1ws/amqWMrMNxZkguJFbal8Y6EFcGhor/AQyuYD1mSZ6N2wnI2rxspzJ6l\nKhbOadpTX8FgXqgiBZbVgE8l35LQg2OJD5awQfh/5gikrnVrYqt7Y1V3XSNAYCck\nXuAVh6WegYwayjZkT5kgD3cc+uGlCyK8riB8AStTeTOOPYJU9KUVuQWO563fiqrC\nDJhlIgsCkNWVa09XdUa4C8HWHGrREyTFGpIJlsNWqmbGnt0GV7yvdVu+lPjv+dc8\nUhhyGqeUC5rRMFTdmVeH0lZYpXbtjIZj0fN7svNGRJJRK50w3ReAaUnrpsaDHhH6\n/nOLldNdk/s