d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/5513eb1ad5d4fe77d99b8ce386e20a991eaa708c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T14:44:25Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T14:44:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(schema): declaration-owned per-object doc annotations (#93) (#96)\n\nAdd WithDocAnnotation(text) on ViewDef and ProcedureDef. Unlike\nCodeObjectOptions.DocPreamble (apply-owned, shared, tolerated by\nValidate*WithOptions), the per-object annotation is declaration-owned: it\nrenders into the live SQL between DocPreamble and OwnershipNotice and\nparticipates in body-drift comparison, so changing the text in code\nproduces validation drift against a live object rendered from the prior\nannotation.\n\n- ViewDef / ProcedureDef gain a docAnnotation field, fluent\n  WithDocAnnotation builder, and a DocAnnotation accessor.\n- renderApplyPrefix / applyOwnershipNoticePrefix /\n  stripConfiguredApplyPrefix gain a declaredAnnotation arg; render order\n  is now DocPreamble, annotation, OwnershipNotice, payload.\n- Apply*WithOptions and Validate*WithOptions thread v.DocAnnotation /\n  p.DocAnnotation through render / strip / canonicalize so declared\n  canon = annComment + body when set.\n- Existing apply-owned tolerance (DocPreamble + OwnershipNotice absent\n  from live still validates) is preserved; declaration-owned annotation\n  is required to match.\n- Tests: builder helpers, render order, strip behavior with annotation\n  in the middle slot, mismatched annotation drift signal, and a SQLite\n  integration test exercising the apply/validate/drift round-trip.\n- README documents the third lane and the declaration-owned drift table.","tree":{"sha":"cedff506ffbd8e926e0b1331bc348db63eb11b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/cedff506ffbd8e926e0b1331bc348db63eb11b9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/5513eb1ad5d4fe77d99b8ce386e20a991eaa708c","verification":{"payload":"tree cedff506ffbd8e926e0b1331bc348db63eb11b9d\nparent 641e0abf3313dd16099223478483f551be2b2282\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1779201865 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779201865 -0500\n\nfeat(schema): declaration-owned per-object doc annotations (#93) (#96)\n\nAdd WithDocAnnotation(text) on ViewDef and ProcedureDef. Unlike\nCodeObjectOptions.DocPreamble (apply-owned, shared, tolerated by\nValidate*WithOptions), the per-object annotation is declaration-owned: it\nrenders into the live SQL between DocPreamble and OwnershipNotice and\nparticipates in body-drift comparison, so changing the text in code\nproduces validation drift against a live object rendered from the prior\nannotation.\n\n- ViewDef / ProcedureDef gain a docAnnotation field, fluent\n  WithDocAnnotation builder, and a DocAnnotation accessor.\n- renderApplyPrefix / applyOwnershipNoticePrefix /\n  stripConfiguredApplyPrefix gain a declaredAnnotation arg; render order\n  is now DocPreamble, annotation, OwnershipNotice, payload.\n- Apply*WithOptions and Validate*WithOptions thread v.DocAnnotation /\n  p.DocAnnotation through render / strip / canonicalize so declared\n  canon = annComment + body when set.\n- Existing apply-owned tolerance (DocPreamble + OwnershipNotice absent\n  from live still validates) is preserved; declaration-owned annotation\n  is required to match.\n- Tests: builder helpers, render order, strip behavior with annotation\n  in the middle slot, mismatched annotation drift signal, and a SQLite\n  integration test exercising the apply/validate/drift round-trip.\n- README documents the third lane and the declaration-owned drift table.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDHdJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVrwQAKuFIcCFIh+O+WdDgofHHvcp\nyjMUrV5tWJRqTNq5E6gGwgmRY4pQdl2ufiYzZ0ZUBXNHjfAA7KJo/OfGKAA0N1/5\n5b/stkc9atDVF4DKfM18LRsIzELd69d+baefLkRV7Mci1SNQI4l7QbSse27OBMi1\n9pK09tQZ8Dylbfn8Ij+wxT30R+sAhkMMVfJsV+fTawQUaPlOO5MSJmA8WzneRfaO\nh2Aec8nM5Kkz6VuAzIrhM+OXPJqfnKirvIukfKCqqwJ1JW52GlIHT6SW+/y6tmRO\nnW4BNe+hUrtrOvDknAzaP6iK1J9tVHt74ReSqAPMOnQ8h5xrB+bBeeAlwmH6Wi5z\nq5OrLIlkRbRT3d5JdCWCPg2X30t5j7q0k9jSJSRqSkqpeThnAazO9pgEnSfFKH9K\nGt6ytNpGXw6jbZPbBzCzUQXf5c9bruRduZGO1UIfAIWuZhKUkZRBcRnw0vbDOfmJ\n3gEUEpMfGkN64Fl0aoFhLkMnRxbpio39/+wxxjG/nhXdMsmOrAggfXtxrVFQxkis\no1ULmtkWBSVKdnzoXDxWaR5kZPGT5yYDV39cqG0ibFmM7kwijMyONv65p5WNWtco\ne7DipCYO955cw1SQk68cjPBWnlHdfNq0NgP/5p2sT+QLYJSVnYD+sZ9dbEV3cfUz\nFqVOHabLLLa/nbKa1esL\n=c6xD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T14:44:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/5513eb1ad5d4fe77d99b8ce386e20a991eaa708c","node_id":"C_kwDOR4JmSdoAKDU1MTNlYjFhZDVkNGZlNzdkOTliOGNlMzg2ZTIwYTk5MWVhYTcwOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/641e0abf3313dd16099223478483f551be2b2282","sha":"641e0abf3313dd16099223478483f551be2b2282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/641e0abf3313dd16099223478483f551be2b2282"}],"sha":"5513eb1ad5d4fe77d99b8ce386e20a991eaa708c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/5513eb1ad5d4fe77d99b8ce386e20a991eaa708c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/641e0abf3313dd16099223478483f551be2b2282/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T14:30:41Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T14:30:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dialect): escape embedded double quotes in SQLite/Postgres QuoteIdentifier (#87) (#95)\n\nSQLiteDialect.QuoteIdentifier and PostgresDialect.QuoteIdentifier wrapped\nthe input in double quotes without escaping any embedded \". An\nidentifier like a\"b rendered as \"a\"b\" — a quoted empty identifier\nfollowed by stray tokens, which the parser rejects.\n\nDouble any embedded \" so the rendered identifier conforms to SQL\nquoted-identifier rules (mirrors MSSQL bracket escaping of ] -> ]]).\n\nAdd focused unit assertions to both dialect tests.","tree":{"sha":"d0d8321ada2095dea38511ee44c38b3d174d636b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/d0d8321ada2095dea38511ee44c38b3d174d636b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/641e0abf3313dd16099223478483f551be2b2282","verification":{"payload":"tree d0d8321ada2095dea38511ee44c38b3d174d636b\nparent 76e3c1b6fcf3bc37c3a2cec9d0296484d4f9d458\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1779201041 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779201041 -0500\n\nfix(dialect): escape embedded double quotes in SQLite/Postgres QuoteIdentifier (#87) (#95)\n\nSQLiteDialect.QuoteIdentifier and PostgresDialect.QuoteIdentifier wrapped\nthe input in double quotes without escaping any embedded \". An\nidentifier like a\"b rendered as \"a\"b\" — a quoted empty identifier\nfollowed by stray tokens, which the parser rejects.\n\nDouble any embedded \" so the rendered identifier conforms to SQL\nquoted-identifier rules (mirrors MSSQL bracket escaping of ] -> ]]).\n\nAdd focused unit assertions to both dialect tests.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDHQRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAN2AQAG/3Rnwz5FtNmbxKP9PlVXk9\nqShcQvv2QiCUSUWe4gsgUINE8nxjgBn/vx0GK7V/gF6L1xFrK8KFHLYAK2dwi27L\nli84kk+ApnH9oSzWPuzzEy++CduzHaLQCd729QXuZ3zpMH8aVZiaG4XCMOz1BnNZ\nx1UZ9aHSP