ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/780d134b67fcdf056f52ffabdf8e9b4547dcf74f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T13:53:38Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T13:53:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mssql): escape single quotes in CreateTable/DropTable guard literals (#91)\n\n* fix(mssql): escape single quotes in CreateTable/DropTable guard literals\n\nCreateTableIfNotExists and DropTableIfExists interpolated the\nbracket-quoted name directly into an OBJECT_ID(N''...'') literal.\nA table name containing a single quote terminated the literal\nmid-string and produced invalid T-SQL.\n\nMirror CreateIndexIfNotExists: escape the single quote by doubling\nit inside the N''...'' literal while keeping the un-escaped form in\nthe CREATE/DROP TABLE clause.\n\nCloses #88.\n\n* chore: remove tracked plan.md and ignore future copies\n\nFinish remaining cleanup from plan-017 / issue #88:\n- delete tracked root plan.md\n- add plan.md to .gitignore so future scratch files stay local\n\nNo code or test changes; MSSQL fix from 78b85ac unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"d6d256433f54ac79a1c40fde37d23326b0eb929e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/d6d256433f54ac79a1c40fde37d23326b0eb929e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/780d134b67fcdf056f52ffabdf8e9b4547dcf74f","verification":{"payload":"tree d6d256433f54ac79a1c40fde37d23326b0eb929e\nparent 741b7380fc01beccfc33198d3972f0201eea2892\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1779198818 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779198818 -0500\n\nfix(mssql): escape single quotes in CreateTable/DropTable guard literals (#91)\n\n* fix(mssql): escape single quotes in CreateTable/DropTable guard literals\n\nCreateTableIfNotExists and DropTableIfExists interpolated the\nbracket-quoted name directly into an OBJECT_ID(N''...'') literal.\nA table name containing a single quote terminated the literal\nmid-string and produced invalid T-SQL.\n\nMirror CreateIndexIfNotExists: escape the single quote by doubling\nit inside the N''...'' literal while keeping the un-escaped form in\nthe CREATE/DROP TABLE clause.\n\nCloses #88.\n\n* chore: remove tracked plan.md and ignore future copies\n\nFinish remaining cleanup from plan-017 / issue #88:\n- delete tracked root plan.md\n- add plan.md to .gitignore so future scratch files stay local\n\nNo code or test changes; MSSQL fix from 78b85ac unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDGtiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAs1gQAHA3xkg6lmg0SqWW8tPdQRRJ\npi+28/u87y+Lx7tm6w1SKqqH0LoSngnOAcmzWJ9aZ91X2R6h/9Bl6xAhAmvUD4cG\nOMeAQf90VhYIZfN55y4E1OXYS4vBdAysM1XVuCVtdlkbLj3z7jh3/ozNdFqH+ejS\n4ApZMy5MDu5oDKGR8LoNh3SO9JrnIA6xGbDZBx9KYNO4Nv62pYOS1TV6kUDC+Czn\nBPIAvENxYpimiT+SyL+U10IzlkU2d87eAfpeXqiEKKwy9UHaBQhkMeSyeiA8JWU+\nsFwD5Ji0C3ddrU4obYg/qyuxP+9l41TFhIqcQN0LEmK4YILhGUyQdP0zFNj5uV0n\nnUFKGoaVftcLjsCM7P+MZkjZFHNJ5zPLlig4S6AAwRMdXYx4NUN3EWvyb/Kf1hYd\nob6m9pCvddcLL7UHkviUcfNfD0o0+nzWjoc0to7y1o6rmwyvMh2H7NG1l2Wpa5gx\n03eblM29jgCq02TzPJqNmcq5dpjGMkyDEynZx8BgA9Vy/Q1Dx1s1hTNw9qkqKNTB\nQ4cpTWNpXunYxEqyxf4BBicUhIn/I5s6PssghkEzR+VUPScu7A3h2ZF2Mo1zNqW/\nkJwDAO/4GTmsnVq8/HfQeL/X4/AJ4ot63IUfbD2sxC9mn9j9vlEB9Rl2mDdlhyNV\nvLK7NQbzO5yStPKdBprD\n=RTG+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T13:53:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-