e/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/f92322da778acc38657a5d4274bc76239303a1de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T00:27:15Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T00:27:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: normalize index column identifiers in drift comparator (#69)\n\nRun both declared and live index column lists through the active\ndialect''s NormalizeIdentifier before comparing. Postgres lowercases\nunquoted PascalCase identifiers to snake_case, so a declared index on\n\"Name\" matches a live index on \"name\" without engine-specific logic.\nSQLite and MSSQL NormalizeIdentifier are identity, so case-preserving\nengines see no behavior change.\n\nError messages still show the user''s original declared and live\nstrings on real drift.\n\nPart of #65.","tree":{"sha":"749ca9a7ffe56a74bb8624cae420834b523301b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/749ca9a7ffe56a74bb8624cae420834b523301b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/f92322da778acc38657a5d4274bc76239303a1de","verification":{"payload":"tree 749ca9a7ffe56a74bb8624cae420834b523301b4\nparent b4e153996f9059d63e580fdd589adf4ba8166ace\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775780835 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775780835 -0500\n\nfix: normalize index column identifiers in drift comparator (#69)\n\nRun both declared and live index column lists through the active\ndialect''s NormalizeIdentifier before comparing. Postgres lowercases\nunquoted PascalCase identifiers to snake_case, so a declared index on\n\"Name\" matches a live index on \"name\" without engine-specific logic.\nSQLite and MSSQL NormalizeIdentifier are identity, so case-preserving\nengines see no behavior change.\n\nError messages still show the user''s original declared and live\nstrings on real drift.\n\nPart of #65.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2EPjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARYkQAIYLB/emYjYWwU+q5pqqVyDd\nHT/f4VbPW0c2VYwg76aZjtTVrkNs/3NesioOuQ971aO98cVH0Gj2GKuyW8s88K5e\nHGuiNIwiQH8Gcd4QgN22io8FACRUhzo0Qph0FgXJA+9RoRGgJSl7c9TYTB75HKpS\nCBRujZ5B2DvSsHqec5jvtcNxyQpGDkIgvc8L5qYktoYGpGawQVlvTOy1b1xXGbBQ\npGrEAECKFF7r1TNlpLJ4gb0tRv5tlh0We6OwDE2YIvvt2v9MoHrLh3MKAPJeODNG\nLV5/wR/qYlBBdr2T4HQfg8cvdfNiahjMBVpYEjmRlkp/BVC8BxpAh5qa91c9RFGd\nCc43fw6KKmUYL6+Lwl6Kn/wzSwefccDtymf7xGrGEcd+OqKXOCbV8BPYSsvm0exF\nxc4zYeAwKeigP2XtDHDF9aiJiXx/goLojmJX/2UQglFHVwZt6Ka0nGjnbfOVmvk5\ngUw+tmbC+7mgpLdIG3cpQ0JQS3OsE8fyVQ8Q/LfJZxB+2TPaQWqU5+wxVlhSPuov\ngSvtLS1KNY934G7yIRAjYBi57otXFsbCuosKDJOVA7jyZFKmO+hD31nMCJwBjv4G\n3EQ0JK/oybkXrdjiBxgQSpB/nYu3utsKnr16m/bFPm7mHcbqt5dvF9NWNeN+2f2s\nW/FgnWhcR8U/ioLxpWIE\n=hH2w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-10T00:27:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0ND