ts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/b4e153996f9059d63e580fdd589adf4ba8166ace/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T00:16:28Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T00:16:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: ignore implicit unique-constraint-backed indexes in drift check (#68)\n\nMatch live single-column unique indexes against declared column-level\nUNIQUE constraints (ColumnDef.Unique and single-column\nTableDef.UniqueColumns). When a live unique index covers exactly one\ndeclared unique column, skip it instead of reporting as unexpected\ndrift. Uses column-set matching, not name-pattern matching, so\nPostgres `<table>_<col>_key` and MSSQL `UQ__<prefix>__<hash>` both\nwork without engine-specific logic.\n\nPart of #65.","tree":{"sha":"8b676b58ec46fc198d438e07f762595e745869a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/8b676b58ec46fc198d438e07f762595e745869a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/b4e153996f9059d63e580fdd589adf4ba8166ace","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b676b58ec46fc198d438e07f762595e745869a2\nparent 5823c7832e15aacdefb164b3792972455c1062c3\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775780188 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775780188 -0500\n\nfix: ignore implicit unique-constraint-backed indexes in drift check (#68)\n\nMatch live single-column unique indexes against declared column-level\nUNIQUE constraints (ColumnDef.Unique and single-column\nTableDef.UniqueColumns). When a live unique index covers exactly one\ndeclared unique column, skip it instead of reporting as unexpected\ndrift. Uses column-set matching, not name-pattern matching, so\nPostgres `<table>_<col>_key` and MSSQL `UQ__<prefix>__<hash>` both\nwork without engine-specific logic.\n\nPart of #65.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nw