wers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/3a69f7ef537777b12cf728bd6ab17588d63b3445/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:13:07Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:13:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: aliased JOIN quoting and tolerant column spacing (#63)\n\n* fix: support aliased JOIN targets and tolerant column spacing\n\n- Parse JOIN targets into base table and optional alias (bare and AS\n  forms) so dialect quoting only applies to the table identifier.\n- Split column lists on comma then trim whitespace per token, removing\n  the dependency on a single \", \" delimiter shape.\n\nFixes #60\nFixes #62\n\n* chore: satisfy gocritic lint in schema package\n\n- Name return values of splitTypeParams for gocritic unnamedResult.\n- Add explanations to two nolint:errcheck directives in writeDiffs.\n\nPre-existing lint violations surfaced by golangci-lint v2.11.4 blocking\nCI on this branch.","tree":{"sha":"91db2d8fdd34623bcc1dd12fd4586066dd2291a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/91db2d8fdd34623bcc1dd12fd4586066dd2291a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/3a69f7ef537777b12cf728bd6ab17588d63b3445","verification":{"payload":"tree 91db2d8fdd34623bcc1dd12fd4586066dd2291a1\nparent 2f692f7ae4818d3a804bc1572987d8da0e5acd26\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775769187 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775769187 -0500\n\nfix: aliased JOIN quoting and tolerant column spacing (#63)\n\n* fix: support aliased JOIN targets and tolerant column spacing\n\n- Parse JOIN targets into base table and optional alias (bare and AS\n  forms) so dialect quoting only applies to the table identifier.\n- Split column lists on comma then trim whitespace per token, removing\n  the dependency on a single \", \" delimiter shape.\n\nFixes #60\nFixes #62\n\n* chore: satisfy gocritic lint in schema package\n\n- Name return values of splitTypeParams for gocritic unnamedResult.\n- Add explanations to two nolint:errcheck directives in writeDiffs.\n\nPre-existing lint violations surfaced by golangci-lint v2.11.4 blocking\nCI on this branch.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2BZjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkuAQAKDsctRfWROhRP8MjxTFjBRS\nEhmSfLoaeECakRak9pGNx/EVn08y5SfXvWM47DoLId0Zr83KkEGb18sv0dPyOetJ\n86q55Zu2V9uwjrLjN5TkMiObx2DxDTG53z/+EOwfTSDq+ffT/9pig8XPDyAANAsB\nOVhUh5ajllLtuJ5Wvu8duYKUR4Hov0F4pctmKM5wEiIW1NBR8Hdw+HQpSNIQ2yuH\n1R2A8Pd/9kLX+H00Rhxo+G2X7NwDgtDs4WKuFW0/6V9s5Qw9vamXM+2ZSzWKedYZ\nx9RimO0dLkyRdMmElXnaGhv6JNxWktlV7QJFH8i0tVQiwXiykZUPhzRi8Am/sPY3\n/vjL9pHfT+zqjQMS1DeHWSg1o5ngoHfNqoNhNHxaXQGY2zYockC0auM+1rF87wos\nwY4mRl0EibS5EilPBpMG4gtrZcWRaqld13x5e8LeYlZw9G/tlfWGXOnendcmHHCW\n9x9TzyXuOyTt2UKod9ATmm8X9Bz0kTDgL1ukFzfI/QUjvhWtI1xsTWCtAwDW8mmD\npQt4nlvqG7rKKatul+Il8aT5Yzt2oqcpeEBEDqB5TBLr1Ar+SPrkNj56Ztc2+mpS\nCYK34JnyuLMSUfVScfiJdYfi0iHr/MCd6+OvPcOU0eMPdStGs+2QLfhBUegZzd4U\nFRUgjx2YQzXLOqoDTWUs\n=Dp0Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-09T21:13:07Z"}},"committer":