","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/9ab4679dbb7c95e64193bde54747bbc064d3136e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T16:41:44Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T16:41:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: avoid duplicate PRIMARY KEY / AUTO INCREMENT in SnapshotString output (#57)\n\nSnapshotString unconditionally appended PRIMARY KEY and AUTO INCREMENT\ntext even when those keywords already appeared in the column type string\n(e.g. SERIAL PRIMARY KEY, INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT). This\nproduced duplicated output like \"SERIAL PRIMARY KEY PRIMARY KEY AUTO\nINCREMENT\".\n\nNow checks whether the type string already contains the relevant\nkeywords before appending, including suppressing AUTO INCREMENT when the\ntype contains SERIAL (Postgres implicit auto-increment).\n\nFixes #56","tree":{"sha":"c4c64c8f7360ee1a9784630b49ef0d36967dd02f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/c4c64c8f7360ee1a9784630b49ef0d36967dd02f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/9ab4679dbb7c95e64193bde54747bbc064d3136e","verification":{"payload":"tree c4c64c8f7360ee1a9784630b49ef0d36967dd02f\nparent ebc53d830aa46355e86c78f26a315e2d79cebb69\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775580104 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775580104 -0500\n\nfix: avoid duplicate PRIMARY KEY / AUTO INCREMENT in SnapshotString output (#57)\n\nSnapshotString unconditionally appended PRIMARY KEY and AUTO INCREMENT\ntext even when those keywords already appeared in the column type string\n(e.g. SERIAL PRIMARY KEY, INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT). This\nproduced duplicated output like \"SERIAL PRIMARY KEY PRIMARY KEY AUTO\nINCREMENT\".\n\nNow checks whether the type string already 