verage\" section to the README.\n\nCloses #51","tree":{"sha":"e5aad119c4880e927863e2184f7f15d78ca3ea84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/e5aad119c4880e927863e2184f7f15d78ca3ea84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/b909ebfbc3c39f5ea9f2514c606f60e309ae0aed","verification":{"payload":"tree e5aad119c4880e927863e2184f7f15d78ca3ea84\nparent bf1340195ece18606c9e34b50c22ae1c7002f618\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775576304 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775576304 -0500\n\ndocs: document drift detection coverage for DiffSchema and ValidateSchema (#54)\n\nAdd doc comments to DiffSchema and ValidateSchema listing the dimensions\nthey compare (columns, indexes) and what they do not yet cover (unique\nconstraints, primary keys, foreign keys, CHECK constraints). Add a\ncorresponding \"Drift Detection Coverage\" section to the README.\n\nCloses #51","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1STwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu9UQACMH3Qc6AvxDaJpE/xThB6W5\nPsOYjsDIno9n+Jbf4Bm/CU4C9qLmspmcQcs/KTF6bcIxFeuuPJt+lWKAVjbBpSdZ\nCnXRWpHDr4WAPb9mvTB0btJFaWqVyqAZ1ZfEb7cAmxvkMDAwDDdQZbf6mAaToR1O\ns8Br58J5bG+LOQV4Qfo3vrD9RuEw/0sqbTLyJbtCK7E6NfUKETQzKfx3btYqmlkG\nn+mDZnRXRtTyqUkuHtXD1Rz2WCEneNo6LNRH+WtNXSc6i0MnEgFApBRXZnsPufG3\npCob+Tn81l7+sLohXsWssp5zRnmwg7LRNzhS7tQonoCiUBtnkzojKBfrUwt4PrSG\nzwlq+68ebkSBfvuQu9FmvOZlJlzpwkN0Kh+NRven1KKx21KaLdq8EDaJFqkB/P0P\n7veUjCC1toIHnMFjsYl/a71xv/NNy4B56skGgtOdExchH6Ji5V2tR/IM13y0nTwI\nWmf5C8Y2ih3QJ6G6arr3SF8KzF4umwbnTKE3TNT+BspUnyPMjJKe+Fd0BGWwXlUN\noknWZZwkzMu++8XLb9Bv7tNfIBspNLl06Lxyfyvnji66VgoJ9MhzkjLQcKRTXl84\niYFn+aWZKHQwyHoCB3KAmtdIJv7b5Bq0vtAXoI9Dj51APCjH/cgZg4FtpCUlWA44\n1PGp/89QjVd2SDyiAvif\n=tB+u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T15:38:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/pri