/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/bf1340195ece18606c9e34b50c22ae1c7002f618/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T15:08:18Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T15:08:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: emit PRIMARY KEY in DDL when ColumnDef.PrimaryKey() is used (#49)\n\nPrimaryKey() set the pk metadata field but ddl() never checked it,\nso Col(\"id\", TypeInt()).PrimaryKey() produced DDL without PRIMARY KEY.\nAdd a pk check in ddl() after the type string, skipping if the type\nalready contains PRIMARY KEY (as with AutoIncrCol and UUIDPKCol).\n\nFixes #47","tree":{"sha":"67f89348a7946fa7c0c97831a18c2e699e80f06f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/67f89348a7946fa7c0c97831a18c2e699e80f06f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/bf1340195ece18606c9e34b50c22ae1c7002f618","verification":{"payload":"tree 67f89348a7946fa7c0c97831a18c2e699e80f06f\nparent e531e142e58a5fd07574d00f8e6d319568b29987\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775574498 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775574498 -0500\n\nfix: emit PRIMARY KEY in DDL when ColumnDef.PrimaryKey() is used (#49)\n\nPrimaryKey() set the pk metadata field but ddl() never checked it,\nso Col(\"id\", TypeInt()).PrimaryKey() produced DDL without PRIMARY KEY.\nAdd a pk check in ddl() after the type string, skipping if the type\nalready contains PRIMARY KEY (as with AutoIncrCol and UUIDPKCol).\n\nFixes #47","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNA