n = ''c''), excluding auto-generated\nindexes from UNIQUE constraints that would cause false positives.\n\nCloses #42","tree":{"sha":"e0faa044325353158375cf36994c24b70e4fb4f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/e0faa044325353158375cf36994c24b70e4fb4f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/e531e142e58a5fd07574d00f8e6d319568b29987","verification":{"payload":"tree e0faa044325353158375cf36994c24b70e4fb4f3\nparent 196715f0a6889bd579086b736fce0065dae991fd\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775573808 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775573808 -0500\n\nfix: report extra live indexes in ValidateSchema (#46)\n\nAdd a second pass in ValidateSchema that detects indexes present in the\nlive database but not declared in the schema, mirroring the existing\nbehavior in DiffSchema. Also narrow the SQLite live index query to only\ninclude user-created indexes (origin = ''c''), excluding auto-generated\nindexes from UNIQUE constraints that would cause false positives.\n\nCloses #42","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RswCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADHcQAHKEoXvO25eeLG/0EIw0eZEE\nLhzogir0j9zHBZGzkDmEkr0CIJojAeYIqYY8GcurX4VF+ebqH62Xz44U9fvclwkz\nq/GArUfWGl+u4gwEP7qv0uuClw/XvYh4TuywP+Z+E4Ni5AmAEc3b+euFruVqgLHB\nErnbDu0v5DdENTDU6KT98gP1OXw+7TApUjmzJ5BdP62nJO9DR6hhHcTed8+m8Hso\n2MK9sjnH6dgFJaKiIGh2OMs4KHD06nPouAvW2tRdkb4Uac08D00FTzEdVpiePWzL\nhk26RdI5ub1YsHchsKX7HQOphjeFHOGg5AVgfuBkj5kawaJA7OjlWp50czrIqZsp\naTVZoJVIm2PL3gnwk90OPBieXzOF9xetAsw2L6cHu3txrzh5JJ43OdMs0Q7M5Nqs\nmoRPHk9yklzm729k3KaSQEKGA4zKQLb/sMEp6vnX1a2OcvRAGOOo97zZ2cQqM7Zz\nVcAMeZwFqyte7C5SmJOGiPnD2GgGL3OTy0z0xJX9J593q0oAqyk0oprV72OcWDHN\nzgcpPcoSH7e9+3GW7tAovQAMYR67SyNT127dUeDeIrsWVJeY5okOGXHiqyCcz+JR\nX1kskeQc5cWushFhRJrMvfiHa/4iU21BZmYVTGK7twJJTaHEsTJDr5mqq8GURuBf\nEO0hYdOyuqX51I1enj+r\n=aLBM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T14:56:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_u