tted from error messages. Add the missing\nblock and corresponding tests.\n\nCloses #43","tree":{"sha":"f6930a0e1fe2375bdda7db68ddbc497a71eca194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/f6930a0e1fe2375bdda7db68ddbc497a71eca194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/a2935bafe229420a17fbf16240300e26aae77b53","verification":{"payload":"tree f6930a0e1fe2375bdda7db68ddbc497a71eca194\nparent 2e96f1a418564be4bbbd2bc97ee947cce1419add\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775573747 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775573747 -0500\n\nfix: include ChangedIndexes in EnsureError.Error() summary (#44)\n\nThe EnsureError.Error() method listed all drift categories except\nChangedIndexes, so index property changes (columns, uniqueness, WHERE\nclause) were silently omitted from error messages. Add the missing\nblock and corresponding tests.\n\nCloses #43","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RrzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsuwQAICT6pH7cxG+wTH4XdJnNd1G\nN0bLICSbD5JTlFR0Tj3963AI3MF9IMPODqffSFIoK7qZLTsXkeThJWkEngGxoT3D\nc1cF8unFQCl+7XOETqdW2Zr5BKuy3rB8vuskb1KZmbgGn2kdtHHMYSO5lEr42LNK\nF1m0jtTDwicxdaW7/pjkW5wquwJh+olaJv2FxIfhwLoH5XUPeajmsl4h7wCn9yfP\nvwbsL1xXVZNRWW3fWUXM0PM8Z4c5hSqOEsmsmfl288Gt8nhmuQ24XI3ZHWCETxcZ\nOM5RVG9cyRb2Wn3aBur8CKFoN2us93IA51GtRhRZqyi3/PANINx1HDQNfVFQrNwj\ngJby/t8+LqR/aLjNgIDKP1DBBTAyYYaUqMoDzf8OwCWyFaFv9frgLdHVHyx0bhcX\nwA8C1AVS5PQHv4L17KMP2uCdOqAFh23alBidh8aCwAF3ae0vKORh0CSo701D5lMz\nlXj2g4ibm1DkIW9LxKhQQF3kWcT7Q6WZEJQ8yXlgv+wZCsMHQkCM7El3Ofyhz89v\nG7P5uZbIKx/4vpseSc8TtT32lSPGsQpxWW599TQTAhRD7SHQBD+2gyhb+TF3yq3E\nB4/TCVETdi/6MM3rDZxdTs+2Kvl8FKmnbvAtjxhKoY8lLYCjGw0d0DOdLu8IN755\nd8DU5swmiKe0nUAznSMj\n=+CLa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T14:55:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","follower