","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/2e96f1a418564be4bbbd2bc97ee947cce1419add/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:36:50Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:36:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve false Postgres drift mismatches for type introspection (#40)\n\nReplace UPPER(data_type) from information_schema.columns with\nUPPER(format_type(atttypid, atttypmod)) from pg_attribute in the\nPostgres live snapshot query. format_type preserves length, precision,\nand scale (e.g., CHARACTER VARYING(255) instead of CHARACTER VARYING).\n\nAdd normalizePostgresAlias to normalizeType so declared types match\nlive types after alias resolution:\n- VARCHAR(n) <-> CHARACTER VARYING(n)\n- TIMESTAMPTZ <-> TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE\n- NUMERIC(p,s) <-> DECIMAL(p,s)\n- SERIAL <-> INTEGER, BIGSERIAL <-> BIGINT\n- BOOL <-> BOOLEAN, INT <-> INTEGER, etc.\n\nCloses #35","tree":{"sha":"aff49c46103c7d730f72d5d7abe640fb8d2ee1a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/aff49c46103c7d730f72d5d7abe640fb8d2ee1a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/2e96f1a418564be4bbbd2bc97ee947cce1419add","verification":{"payload":"tree aff49c46103c7d730f72d5d7abe640fb8d2ee1a7\nparent 20f17eda862ea33e72ee4c1af4c359b8524bfed5\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775572610 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775572610 -0500\n\nfix: resolve false Postgres drift mismatches for type introspection (#40)\n\nReplace UPPER(data_type) from information_schema.columns with\nUPPER(format_type(atttypid, atttypmod)) from pg_attribute in the\nPostgres live snapshot query. format_type preserves length, precision,\nand scale (e.g., CHARACTER VARYING(255) instead of CHARACTER VARYING).\n\nAdd normalizePostgresAlias to normalizeType so declared types match\nlive types after alias resolution:\n- VARCHAR(n) <-> CHARACTER VARYING(n)\n- TIMESTAMPTZ <-> TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE\n- NUMERIC(p,s) <-> DECIMAL(p,s)\n- SERIAL <-> INTEGER, BIGSERIAL <-> BIGINT\n- BOOL <-> BOOLEAN, INT <-> INTEGER, etc.\n\nCloses #35","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RaCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4ZgQAEXU48tIruiNjf6M6ivHwQe0\nKoKZCly3MEP6jLpCez3OXC9kfeDFbiCNcalsP6UndD/bDrmS1JkM50l7/RZNAmFZ\nz0hCNSIeur67EPWh6F/ZJOo6csFneZpKD9LYds/tD1j/eiX/z6VeZNtxRUuz2ixH\niLd7Q8vF1fa1DaypXUk1OAKKFBFH9iJ+6o4FbFZV+0W0KcbynPhe6XcABjf4w0sC\n818iK0ZRplgtTkU/OXgCoVt+SeRDt9qE94i3qCspkjhkkzXgzWrjRXWl+1IEWVMb\nIw++O2fx83pxPWuo+CUzH/MOM7j/9obSUNAhen/VqSRoVZpz1ZG3oDBfVQOg7Tca\nPp71LZfo8T88wBM0z+C3Towuz62IGQwjfmoqSgNkMbyvZ4+s5wIAwXMcakJXsTmR\nCdWhTocsoux9UueFHBmLd/zlKkc8QFSgX1EpL4Zpr8oSlFa8Q/B8stsdhHSBfqhi\nyjxbdMvkZS/Lsd95H6hivIHXd+6ykkAKM1GeBVhm3C8a/XCSFzTOJlh1fggdC4ti\nOYpzHZ9txusZV2l3MY9YSrCQxcWAkUI/ndwTtqv+V9TbS9xfsxt/1fZdRsdyQ3VN\nH47CQf0z5vTgHblFYIJMgurSJnxXNcIzquQJ6yjjpSLmh8gjpJjaESTMMb+OR1ty\nLacmK0z5ZDtAARsEAgnM\n=9GOb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T14:36:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/2e96f1a418564be4bbbd2bc97ee947cce1419add","node_id":"C_kwDOR4JmSdoAKDJlOTZmMWE0MTg1NjRiZTRiYmJkMmJjOTdlZTk0N2NjZTE0MTlhZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/20f17eda862ea33e72ee4c1af4c359b8524bfed5","sha":"20f17eda862ea33e72ee4c1af4c359b8524bfed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/20f17eda862ea33e72ee4c1af4c359b8524bfed5"}],"sha":"2e96f1a418564be4bbbd2bc97ee947cce1419add","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/2e96f1a418564be4bbbd2bc97ee947cce1419add"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/20f17eda862ea33e72ee4c1af4c359b8524bfed5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:36:31Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:36:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: filter included columns and order by key_ordinal in MSSQL index query (#39)\n\nThe MSSQL index subquery in queryIndexesMSSQL was missing two critical\nclauses: it did not exclude included (non-key) columns and did not\norder by key_ordinal. This caused index drift comparisons to include\nspurious columns and produce non-deterministic column ordering.\n\nAdd ic.is_included_column = 0 filter and ORDER BY ic.key_ordinal to\nthe subquery. Extract the query as a package-level variable for\ntestability and add unit tests verifying both clauses are present.\n\nFixes #37","tree":{"sha":"6566402d8c28de0faf30829ee67c220030954a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/6566402d8c28de0faf30829ee67c220030954a61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/20f17eda862ea33e72ee4c1af4c359b8524bfed5","verification":{"payload":"tree 6566402d8c28de0faf30829ee67c220030954a61\nparent 043182f7775e65e7d6066442e55e768c339cf9ac\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775572591 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775572591 -0500\n\nfix: filter included columns and order by key_ordinal in MSSQL index query (#39)\n\nThe MSSQL index subquery in queryIndexesMSSQL was missing two critical\nclauses: it did not exclude included (non-key) columns and did not\norder by key_ordinal. This caused index drift comparisons to include\nspurious columns and produce non-deterministic column ordering.\n\nAdd ic.is_included_column = 0 filter and ORDER BY ic.key_ordinal to\nthe subquery. Extract the query as a package-level variable for\ntestability and add unit tests verifying both clauses are present.\n\nFixes #37","reason":"valid","signature"