side\nsingle-quoted string literals while still normalizing SQL keywords.\n\nFixes #36","tree":{"sha":"bd15237c327b592c8b5674dc5a2a1e54ab029f71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/bd15237c327b592c8b5674dc5a2a1e54ab029f71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/043182f7775e65e7d6066442e55e768c339cf9ac","verification":{"payload":"tree bd15237c327b592c8b5674dc5a2a1e54ab029f71\nparent 7950feba671857d0f536e0887121534a27864e95\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775572566 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775572566 -0500\n\nfix: preserve case-sensitive default literals during drift comparison (#38)\n\nnormalizeDefault was lowercasing the entire expression including string\nliteral contents, causing ''Admin'' and ''admin'' to compare as equal.\nNow only non-quoted segments are lowercased, preserving case inside\nsingle-quoted string literals while still normalizing SQL keywords.\n\nFixes #36","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RZWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAb04QAJ4vIQGm6D26kc8iZ6Ie+ZfV\nddIXtH8jhQuLD6Hq3zlfNdWdrVwQ16Dy41x07TymOQjleMXlqqTrHU2OGM09KiKI\nHrzgudOxhtGuzOxquDXwcLsxn4XFFYo4DR9c3eP1mJQTXPZZqQnyDlMHCHP90a0n\nh5hbAm4S8lf1aS8blU89gVSiDKF/6vlLPEQwZD+9clhuPeHsDfOyobp1TxrHYMGe\n514hFs1uBQeyu+LmuwEoNermiAuSnjxB/hPLA+8weh3oGQHC6MlYMUsIF/ejUGFm\ns1v9ddyRDgSLH4+jsPxR6z27czfEfQKyXRS9lQxCiY6d7ZjqkYylaHZjDvQZy259\n7so6nOTgUHAfPEzQsWw1xM6x+mlsUprpQVwIOqXMQWZK0y2Rz5jZkL5VxQQ+yYF4\nxuMzZiscDUTVZIcETr5D4uSUtsET4FnuyCOobdcG7f/aKN+oE1Mg7pIn4izdVoyC\nW91kUS84tMB3qkEidIFi2UXQZX3OC/+pbL6qXwyuf/atT2VZAC8SUhL7qz963cRe\n+bU0gtjHe75lPWCLCHHXYrGmqDK54nlhGLwVc0rUPm1fmUSrL5/Gs94IjasENyAF\nA0FJsSM91erOf98gdRQItrv3l2ISE3JIJAvpxzDddub+BtG5eV/TppR7N4F6FM72\nkG8GBO/c0SXhKnfolywT\n=GNnZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T14:36:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api