"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/7950feba671857d0f536e0887121534a27864e95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:22:59Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:22:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: normalize identifiers before quoting in dbrepo builders (#34)\n\nSelectBuilder, UpdateBuilder, DeleteBuilder, and fragment helpers\n(ColumnsQ, SetClauseQ, InsertIntoQ, BulkInsertInto, UpsertIntoQ) all\ncalled QuoteIdentifier without first calling NormalizeIdentifier. This\ncaused PascalCase names like \"Users\" to be quoted as-is on Postgres\ninstead of being lowercased to \"users\", creating a mismatch with the\nschema package which normalizes correctly.\n\nFixes #29","tree":{"sha":"d7edcad18ffa1e9b2231c36ca6b3e1b5817bdbf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/d7edcad18ffa1e9b2231c36ca6b3e1b5817bdbf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/7950feba671857d0f536e0887121534a27864e95","verification":{"payload":"tree d7edcad18ffa1e9b2231c36ca6b3e1b5817bdbf4\nparent 759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775571779 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775571779 -0500\n\nfix: normalize identifiers before quoting in dbrepo builders (#34)\n\nSelectBuilder, UpdateBuilder, DeleteBuilder, and fragment helpers\n(ColumnsQ, SetClauseQ, InsertIntoQ, BulkInsertInto, UpsertIntoQ) all\ncalled QuoteIdentifier without first calling NormalizeIdentifier. This\ncaused PascalCase names like \"Users\" to be quoted as-is on Postgres\ninstead of being lowercased to \"users\", creating a mismatch with the\nschema package which normalizes correctly.\n\nFixes #29","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1RNDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAR6cQAHu2cRfQLY6VOGuaB3yUX6yM\nAUHK2ceghAhc3aJfmu5+dlZ7us5/zvD4qvhcqfLDwy5HubodQe6vYKK5937wBO2Z\n87TLF8VwQ9GS0RQQZAK2Jqii5GmhvKkMtW8ZsT1PLkovc5anWiADF6gTLKEGYDY7\nuCdTtkS0oTS+lGQWPeh3Q04BztE7cWUck90c5b4aPVYHYqLywGWJ56IM1jmyqOwE\nAtluY/9y85xZo+LjiwF3i4A+zf0Chp7bxw36v4Pd7ZY+7mdqcLFopT3KqvckCDfh\nWIKMhV2WgqCM4yvNggV4+LAzURoFkUfy+F4yk53w9qcrZ3m/1jGzJp6G6nGTEOSn\nJp4YB4uFbZR8xn8957PIQBCyeT1kThKvfZ1Z1wMnpP350+DLrwy8vOLbg8RLHVbO\n1O4sZoR3gAxBBqHN+kqFxdEIK0O/TRExz/8N4p+QZEYTHWNsxMBpJI7gjl6gf5UF\n/u9a13ktAjT+bBjnGPERP7OgNkgYGoscFWs3FacMx0CGodhySLkaNrpomVtL23LM\nRV0KVNrGtsJRmvPn4zSkoYIaeIuIieRAYZsAyrFIrYND7GTLlycBssPtFDvKClXb\nU24KOp4zpXLSF6nfxMV4XK2nEyl4Zx7ibN2SrLH04m/212nwV8ei2530/DVmEljC\nhnrbhrF5W6PGI6fTAXdW\n=Hwcm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T14:22:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/7950feba671857d0f536e0887121534a27864e95","node_id":"C_kwDOR4JmSdoAKDc5NTBmZWJhNjcxODU3ZDBmNTM2ZTA4ODcxMjE1MzRhMjc4NjRlOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7","sha":"759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7"}],"sha":"7950feba671857d0f536e0887121534a27864e95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/7950feba671857d0f536e0887121534a27864e95"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:22:37Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:22:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: enrich live index snapshots for reliable drift detection (#33)\n\nLiveIndexSnapshot now captures parsed columns ([]string), uniqueness\n(bool), and WHERE clause (string) matching the declared IndexSnapshot\nfields. Per-dialect queryIndexes implementations:\n\n- SQLite: uses pragma_index_info for columns, pragma_index_list for\n  unique flag, and sqlite_master SQL parsing for WHERE clauses\n- Postgres: uses pg_index for indisunique, pg_attribute for columns,\n  and pg_get_expr(indpred) for partial predicates\n- MSSQL: uses sys.indexes.is_unique, sys.index_columns for columns,\n  and filter_definition for filtered indexes\n\nDiffSchema and ValidateSchema now compare index columns, uniqueness,\nand WHERE clauses — not just index names.\n\nFixes #28","tree":{"sha":"60c2db8b829859bf763fac893fd073b521313d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/60c2db8b829859bf763fac893fd073b521313d39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 60c2db8b829859bf763fac893fd073b521313d39\nparent 7982f19b41cd70fa2c8d09f45ab268c17574c3f9\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775571757 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775571757 -0500\n\nfeat: enrich live index snapshots for reliable drift detection (#33)\n\nLiveIndexSnapshot now captures parsed columns ([]string), uniqueness\n(bool), and WHERE clause (string) matching the declared IndexSnapshot\nfields. Per-dialect queryIndexes implementations:\n\n- SQLite: uses pragma_index_info for columns, pragma_index_list for\n  unique flag, and sqlite_master SQL parsing for WHERE clauses\n- Postgres: uses pg_index for indisunique, pg_attribute for columns,\n  and pg_get_expr(indpred) for partial predicates\n- MSSQL: uses sys.indexes.is_unique, sys.index_columns for columns,\n  and filter_definition for filtered indexes\n\nDiffSchema and ValidateSchema now compare index columns, uniqueness,\nand WHERE clauses — not just index names.\n\nF