YTY2ZjE4MWFjYzQwZWUxMDcxYzFmNTczZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/chuck/commit/7982f19b41cd70fa2c8d09f45ab268c17574c3f9","sha":"7982f19b41cd70fa2c8d09f45ab268c17574c3f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/7982f19b41cd70fa2c8d09f45ab268c17574c3f9"}],"sha":"759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/759a8fee1e8172a66f181acc40ee1071c1f573d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/7982f19b41cd70fa2c8d09f45ab268c17574c3f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:22:21Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T14:22:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: expand drift detection to cover type, default, and constraint mismatches (#32)\n\nDiffSchema and ValidateSchema previously only compared column presence,\nnullability, and index names. This extends both to detect type mismatches\nand default value mismatches between declared and live schemas.\n\n- Add Mismatches, DeclaredDefault, and LiveDefault fields to ColumnDiff\n- Add normalizeType to strip constraint keywords from compound type strings\n  (e.g., \"INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT\" -> \"INTEGER\") to avoid false\n  positives on auto-increment columns\n- Add normalizeDefault to handle parenthesized/cased default values\n- Add type and default mismatch validation errors to ValidateSchema\n- Add tests for type mismatch, default mismatch, multiple mismatches,\n  and auto-increment false positive prevention\n\nCloses #27","tree":{"sha":"24545be5a9e7a874008a3685a096e3a6e1cad12c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/24545be5a9e7a874008a3685a096e3a6e1cad12c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/7982f19b41cd70fa2c8d09f45ab268c17574c3f9","verification":{"payload":"tree 24545be5a9e7a874008a3685a096e3a6e1cad12c\nparent d5b5e5a28479240760f38c5b989edfc2ea5993dd\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775571741 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775571741 -0500\n\nfeat: expand drift detection to cover type, default, and constraint mismatches (#32)\n\nDiffSchema and ValidateSchema previously only compared column presence,\nnullability, and index names. This extends both to detect type mismatches\nand default value mismatches between declared and live schemas.\n\n- Add Mismatches, DeclaredDefault, and LiveDefault fields to ColumnDiff\n- Add normalizeType to strip constraint keywords from compound type strings\n  (e.g., \"INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT\" -> \"INTEGER\") to avoid false\n  positives on auto-increment columns\n- Add normalizeDefault to handle parenthesized/cased default values\n- Add type and default mismatch validation errors to ValidateSchema\n- Add tests for type mismatch, default mismatch, multiple mismatches,\n  and auto-increment false positive prevention\n\nCloses #27","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEG