"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/7d098ca84a8bd1b33c384a56ccd2253ace9e627c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:28:25Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:28:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add unique and partial index support (#23)\n\nExtend IndexDef to support unique indexes, partial (filtered) indexes,\nand combined unique+partial indexes across all three dialects (Postgres,\nSQLite, MSSQL).\n\nNew constructors: UniqueIndex, PartialIndex, UniquePartialIndex, plus a\nWhere() method for attaching filter conditions. Snapshot and\nSnapshotString output now includes uniqueness and WHERE metadata.\n\nCloses #7","tree":{"sha":"220a936d9af0f1da1da29094da7e3d27b1933f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/220a936d9af0f1da1da29094da7e3d27b1933f68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/7d098ca84a8bd1b33c384a56ccd2253ace9e627c","verification":{"payload":"tree 220a936d9af0f1da1da29094da7e3d27b1933f68\nparent 1403523d906556ae9c08ff592084f51cd0d6f73c\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775266105 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775266105 -0500\n\nfeat: add unique and partial index support (#23)\n\nExtend IndexDef to support unique indexes, partial (filtered) indexes,\nand combined unique+partial indexes across all three dialects (Postgres,\nSQLite, MSSQL).\n\nNew constructors: UniqueIndex, PartialIndex, UniquePartialIndex, plus a\nWhere() method for attaching filter conditions. Snapshot and\nSnapshotString output now includes uniqueness and WHERE metadata.\n\nCloses #7","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp0Gk5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2IwQAGwf6XxYXJQIERZtEukyTDgC\nEFqdMggzsvyMSX0xDsK41dsoFhzuMLiI1oKPMslupWRkEHZodH8Iq