,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/1403523d906556ae9c08ff592084f51cd0d6f73c"}],"sha":"7d098ca84a8bd1b33c384a56ccd2253ace9e627c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/7d098ca84a8bd1b33c384a56ccd2253ace9e627c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/1403523d906556ae9c08ff592084f51cd0d6f73c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:28:23Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:28:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add JOIN composition on SelectBuilder (#22)\n\nAdd Join() and LeftJoin() methods to SelectBuilder for composing\nmulti-table queries. JOIN clauses appear between FROM and WHERE in\ngenerated SQL. Table names in JOIN clauses are dialect-quoted; ON\nconditions pass through as raw SQL. Dot-qualified column names\n(Table.Column) are quoted per-part when a dialect is set.\n\nCountQuery() also includes JOIN clauses for accurate counts.\n\nCloses #4","tree":{"sha":"4826e1c88d12b47ecb7c3a364abbc34b80ce0b0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/4826e1c88d12b47ecb7c3a364abbc34b80ce0b0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/1403523d906556ae9c08ff592084f51cd0d6f73c","verification":{"payload":"tree 4826e1c88d12b47ecb7c3a364abbc34b80ce0b0a\nparent a081f0a7a6fc6dd356d2316e9226cb0f02b05c97\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775266103 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775266103 -0500\n\nfeat: add JOIN composition on SelectBuilder (#22)\n\nAdd Join() and LeftJoin() methods to SelectBuilder for composing\nmulti-table queries. JOIN clauses appear between FROM and WHERE in\ngenerated SQL. Table names in JOIN clauses are dialect-quoted; ON\nconditions pass through as raw SQL. Dot-qualified column names\n(Table.Column) are quoted per-part when a dialect is set.\n\nCountQuery() also includes JOIN clauses for accurate counts.\n\nCloses #4","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp0Gk3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMSQQAAZKbq7SHtzAYWG9IgBu5AbV\nMCXML0W8G1utRfoRDXT9gC5EnyZundsPWC0bNQaB/gNUaUacDNpree48AANgOUya\nUxorBCqnV8Al4rCyoUrOScUxNCQ2ATLQVbO5aUN8t3VF0bS4FlFhRvNOp6n6GfVf\nWj98FEYmQvukBS3eGJslQNi+dUpqDP0XULbd4ORXmTerz1zv78CTnq/K+OqsWD9J\nZk7lg82I4H8g333rHzmSFKSGjgYk7AGyCuV96oG4Cn8BEaP73cPowGLHttqdMolz\n9mhx4p955KmLncugdMbprJKepOXGytLFOBmf3ZnZQlkpqcvFqE/uwk2ayBapAC4i\nYRjkzZ5BSuH+Xr66/jrSxpCk3CqY8bbK5jY2W5k81AiKU7Qn12tDcsmz8EQzfSnC\nMzYzleH1twbxxpIigdyVP9pyuqx0uUAT6Q1JOB98ZnFh1Rm7CXiSvAg4TzrYH2jx\nUNY9owCTVmMJXUD2KOGzOdcc4aZiQbqTXtq7tig3XiwnFXLeZ4y/yPFyLyfAJazm\n2+034DqHOI1NjvcTl/waUWhQgAxxLrphp2mRijC46iVnFOKasbWfckyKJk95Y7AX\niOuoi3x6aO74epFQ2XjmHHVXhblu1WSzWvPbQUyxxgmHmBnn1NxXCJVpXT46XA5a\nqg8gQxjliJxVYMpopOAl\n=XgEr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-04T01:28:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https:/