rl":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/commits/a081f0a7a6fc6dd356d2316e9226cb0f02b05c97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:20:42Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T01:20:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add UPSERT builder (INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE) (#21)\n\nAdd dialect-aware Upsert method to DDLWriter interface and implement\nacross all three dialects:\n- Postgres/SQLite: INSERT INTO ... ON CONFLICT (key) DO UPDATE SET ...\n- MSSQL: MERGE ... USING ... ON ... WHEN MATCHED/NOT MATCHED ...\n\nAdd UpsertInto and UpsertIntoQ helpers in dbrepo that automatically\nbuild the conflict/update clauses from column lists, using EXCLUDED\nreferences for Postgres/SQLite and Source references for MSSQL.\n\nCloses #9","tree":{"sha":"add46aaa0325ebddfbfde1efb4c763185f10594a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/add46aaa0325ebddfbfde1efb4c763185f10594a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/a081f0a7a6fc6dd356d2316e9226cb0f02b05c97","verification":{"payload":"tree add46aaa0325ebddfbfde1efb4c763185f10594a\nparent 4d138ce678b86d2722d2a092ea9ec3e27de393b5\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775265642 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775265642 -0500\n\nfeat: add UPSERT builder (INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE) (#21)\n\nAdd dialect-aware Upsert method to DDLWriter interface and implement\nacross all three dialects:\n- Postgres/SQLite: INSERT INTO ... ON CONFLICT (key) DO UPDATE SET ...\n- MSSQL: MERGE ... USING ... ON ... WHEN MATCHED/NOT MATCHED ...\n\nAdd UpsertInto and UpsertIntoQ helpers in dbrepo that automatically\nbuild the conflict/update clauses from column lists, using EXCLUDED\nreferences for Postgres/SQLite and Source references for MSSQL.\n\nCloses #9","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp0GdqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVJIQAE6fjN6ZpZKQ+fkDowZOnWgg\nMTRvXqkiuxnXq17hxEn/oCqxl2dnuNoEngeEWu1j9OdQ+QWHUpegtcpmrUIlsZax\nBO5RMbFehYUSkOZ0CWo9MkhS8lTXSu43VgetRjSuaHRYRAizI+xW4ksh9A+W4CGY\neBu7H9MIDPaAaDyG+KM/gn75Eb2/9xSiQMb6ujpkCAtOpI8hwGS9EcrCUnsBxY3K\nDnEgpOMia0P2cdX48KlUUXm8Qthf1DbR1PNVvjxEEvAKwF73wZ1EULPWQufBuHG3\nBKCzFKYX0N7ZQStTrdWUvnhfqz/KBJ6HQpuCqKdmR+paduViAQEfrMQMSxValX1O\nfJhXuniUqqUmgtyQRRhwMBP91MBxu82T80mGfXV0vg7U9LhvIHlf6XaxGcOqs+Nz\naJEQf/4rK9jxeb3kFQ7l/jmfUyyuy1H/lR+ItyfEFjr/RUqlRM9XpNoYIE/FNN3P\nWE6mhIvB/u5QtZsWPtBofJXJailZvPAIiL0zhZEgiLD/6dVDvt///bBwsdvzThEB\nC++CcdnM9PkcMxgrRouDG1Opf1tKmK7GrgL/KxbZE8Qc/bAg3S/E1YeWCC24DwsQ\nFa8H1bqnc6DBkLpceeAcrrlXCvP4TptnmXB9uvYVuFH9IIy4WmEDmbejW72q3/yM\ngsTMm2EpnpDbXg6AvOlG\n=uXU5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-04T01:20:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su