"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add BulkInsertInto for multi-row INSERT with dialect placeholders (#20)\n\nAdds BulkInsertInto(dialect, table, cols, rowCount) to the dbrepo\npackage. It generates multi-row INSERT statements using the dialect''s\npositional placeholder style ($1/$2 for Postgres, ? for SQLite,\n@p1/@p2 for MSSQL) and quoted identifiers.\n\nParameter limit enforcement is left to the caller, with limits\ndocumented in the function comment.\n\nCloses #5","tree":{"sha":"2f96d1efae2a91aca7bd59c08e619de820721046","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/trees/2f96d1efae2a91aca7bd59c08e619de820721046"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/chuck/git/commits/4d138ce678b86d2722d2a092ea9ec3e27de393b5","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f96d1efae2a91aca7bd59c08e619de820721046\nparent 13c5f420f16af843ff1c1cef1bdab43087ceb09b\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775265513 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775265513 -0500\n\nfeat: add BulkInsertInto for multi-row INSERT with dialect placeholders (#20)\n\nAdds BulkInsertInto(dialect, table, cols, rowCount) to the dbrepo\npackage. It generates multi-row INSERT statements using the dialect''s\npositional placeholder style ($1/$2 for Postgres, ? for SQLite,\n@p1/@p2 for MSSQL) and quoted identifiers.\n\nParameter limit enforcement is left to the caller, with limits\ndocumented in the function comment.\n\nCloses #5","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp0GbpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwn4QABSNsid1HPKd8qQqdHkJomlk\nTDzXumOxA9ntnOmcof48nPfOlEq7KYprSKmu6ACPSH14WxCWdSvFk7gheWH34i40\ny9mnZw438YenaOCWrt+23jtYTYILDAR27Wv3bmOgQ3zUk8+VdCMud2LzL3ON6bWE\nELYxaFjvlrB72gqpTm+dtNppeuEGTJBoQt3a4RX5nNJSVk9nFl7btBFSqB6+Tqoi\nQaNn7O7MDwinfcS+x0mDy2nMKsZ561wJIjvYhgAFKysKYVaSJQzvM5jHHLYHoXC7\ntQcPbTuM071GkGreqdxqgBjuOOASzfsMt9UExjZczIHV9CRkHtVv43H+Y5YB8Ri+\n39iLdHbCXBMj1FxWY+rG7H5yNzTPTs3j8MFTXRTFUN4mHGKrw41V8IJTn8wljHNG\nOixD4c/Nf