gistry design documented (replaces _INCLUDED_H2 frozenset in Stage 5.7-E)\n\nDesign correction: invoke-when / invoke-never-when frontmatter fields must be plain\nEnglish — they are read by LLMs for autonomous skill selection, not only by Python\ncode. Previous claim (\"SkillLoader-only, LLM never sees them\") was wrong. CLAUDE.md\nRule 14 updated with authoring rule; IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN 5.7-D updated with audit\nchecklist; framework-doc update items added.\n\nStage 5.8 Express Mode spec: src/express.py API + src/cli.py express subcommand,\nmode-filtered skill loading, Layer 1 behavioral override, 5 candidate skills,\nBDD test list; dependency on Stage 5.7-E called out explicitly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fd63df9f1f3908b34baee63343b44c9b8b01ead","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/5fd63df9f1f3908b34baee63343b44c9b8b01ead"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/5a9ad36da812b823497b8c2f1d5d9d444f620464","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/5a9ad36da812b823497b8c2f1d5d9d444f620464","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKDVhOWFkMzZkYTgxMmI4MjM0OTdiOGMyZjFkNWQ5ZDQ0NGY2MjA0NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/b50936690c1c19ceafd3bf643b2f8a91696c6e33","sha":"b50936690c1c19ceafd3bf643b2f8a91696c6e33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/b50936690c1c19ceafd3bf643b2f8a91696c6e33"}],"sha":"5a9ad36da812b823497b8c2f1d5d9d444f620464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/5a9ad36da812b823497b8c2f1d5d9d444f620464"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/b50936690c1c19ceafd3bf643b2f8a91696c6e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T09:02:33Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T09:02:33Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"feat: Stage 5b diagram_tools + consistent macro regeneration across all write paths\n\n- src/agents/tools/diagram_tools.py: 4 agent-facing tools for SA/SwA\n  (generate_er_content, generate_er_relations, validate_diagram, render_diagram);\n  register_diagram_tools() wires them to the agent; regenerate_macros is\n  intentionally NOT registered — auto-triggered transparently instead.\n- src/agents/tools/_diagram_io.py: internal helpers split out to keep\n  diagram_tools.py within 350-LoC hard limit; uses ModelRepository (same\n  registry as universal_tools + MCP) for artifact lookup.\n- write_tools.py: _has_archimate_display() + _regenerate_macros_for() helpers;\n  write_artifact auto-triggers macro regen when content contains §display ###archimate.\n- watch_tools.py: _regenerate_macros_for_roots() helper; watcher loop and\n  model_tools_refresh now rebuild _macros.puml after any model-entities change.\n- roles.py: SA and SwA builders now call register_diagram_tools().\n- scripts/demo_setup.py: PM-style brief prompts (no skill re-injection);\n  --phase-a-only flag; teardown-before-scaffold already in place.\n- scripts/demo_verify.py: multi-path fallback checks for AV doc and entities.\n- BDD tests: 8 scenarios in tests/agents/test_diagram_tools.py (202 tests total).\n- IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md / CLAUDE.md / README.md: end-of-session checklist complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bf8d77ebd9bbeb663c790ae818cdb86ae7b31c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/6bf8d77ebd9bbeb663c790ae818cdb86ae7b31c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/b50936690c1c19ceafd3bf643b2f8a91696c6e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1