"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/de6d2b85f91ae96be37b71e7e4ee0154a54bd5e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T23:49:24Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T23:49:24Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"feat: Stage 5 integration test + runtime bug fixes (6/7 demo checks pass)\n\nBDD tests (194 total, +75 this batch):\n- tests/orchestration/: 48 scenarios (routing fns x7, graph compile, 15 nodes, initial_state)\n- tests/events/: 5 scenarios (Alembic migration idempotency, round-trip, downgrade, column contract)\n- tests/sources/: 12 scenarios (TargetRepoManager config parsing, access control, worktrees)\n- tests/agents/: 10 scenarios (universal_tools return types, JSON-serializability, graceful degradation)\n\nNew implementation:\n- src/agents/memento_store.py — SQLite MementoStore (upsert, per engagement+agent+phase)\n- src/models/memento.py — MementoState Pydantic model with field validators\n- src/agents/tools/target_repo_tools.py — list/read/scan/write target repo tools + role-scoped registration\n- src/sources/: SourceAdapter protocol + TargetRepoManager (multi-repo, git worktrees, access control)\n- alembic.ini + src/events/migrations/: idempotent baseline migration (CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS)\n\nRuntime bug fixes found during live LLM integration run:\n- universal_tools.search_artifacts: SearchResult is not iterable; iterate .hits\n- universal_tools.list_artifacts: ArtifactSummary has no to_dict(); build dict from fields\n- universal_tools.read_artifact: dict return must be json.dumps(result, default=str)\n- write_tools.write_artifact: boundary violation now returns error string (model self-corrects)\n- write_tools: _derive_artifact_id() auto-emits artifact events from TYPE-NNN filename pattern\n- base.py: retries=3, max_tokens=8192 (Haiku hit 4096 ceiling mid-tool-call with large content)\n- session.py: register_read_only_target_repo_tools added to invoke_specialist\n\nDemo (scripts/demo_setup.py):\n- Always tears down ENG-DEMO before scaffold for clean state\n- Entity YAML frontmatter format example + valid artifact-type values in task prompt\n- Clean error messages (exception type shown, no raw traceback)\n- engagements/ENG-DEMO/ added to .gitignore (ephemeral, rebuilt each run)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e69fbdc053eec05124c39a1ac2af2040d32a0c40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/e69fbdc053eec05124c39a1ac2af2040d32a0c40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/de6d2b85f91ae96be37b71e7e4ee0154a54bd5e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/de6d2b85f91ae96be37b71e7e4ee0154a54bd5e2","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKGRlNmQyYjg1ZjkxYWU5NmJlMzdiNzFlN2U0ZWUwMTU0YTU0YmQ1ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2","sha":"a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2"}],"sha":"de6d2b85f91ae96be37b71e7e4ee0154a54bd5e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/de6d2b85f91ae96be37b71e7e4ee0154a54bd5e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:31:22Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:31:22Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"feat: Stage 5a/5b/5c/5.6-B implementation complete\n\nEventStore (5a):\n- Public snapshot API: create_snapshot(), replay_from_latest_snapshot(),\n  check_snapshot_interval()\n- export.py: write_event_yaml uses PyYAML; import_from_yaml() implemented\n  for disaster-recovery YAML→SQLite rebuild\n\nEvent replay architecture refactor:\n- StateBuilder._HANDLERS dict replaces match/case dispatch (data-driven;\n  add one entry per new event type)\n- StateBuilder.from_state() + _CycleBuilder.from_state() enable O(delta)\n  incremental replay seeded from a snapshot\n- replay.py thin-loop architecture: _run_events() shared by replay_events()\n  and apply_events_to_state(); no duplicated dispatch\n\nAgent layer (5b):\n- src/models/learning.py: LearningEntry Pydantic model\n- src/agents/learning_store.py: LearningStore (LangGraph BaseStore + file\n  durable tier + graph expansion)\n- src/agents/tools/pm_tools.py: 5 PM decision tools (invoke_specialist,\n  evaluate_gate, batch_cqs, record_decision, trigger_review)\n- src/events/models/{specialist,decision,review}.py: new event payloads;\n  CQBatchedPayload added; EngagementCompletedPayload added\n- src/agents/roles.py: per-role build_*_agent factory for all 9 roles\n- src/agents/__init__.py: AGENT_IDS + get_agent() lazy singleton cache\n\nOrchestration layer (5c):\n- src/orchestration/pm_decision.py: PMDecision structured output model\n- src/orchestration/graph_state.py: aligned with spec — pm_decision field,\n  algedonic_active flag, current_agent/current_skill; flat fields removed\n- src/orchestration/routing.py: all 7 routing functions per spec\n- src/orchestration/nodes.py: build_node_fns(session) factory — all 15\n  nodes as closures over EngagementSession\n- src/orchestration/graph.py: build_sdlc_graph(session) compiled graph\n- src/agents/base.py: result_type param added to build_agent()\n\nModel and doc corrections (5.6-B):\n- AIF-002, CST-001, APP-001/005/007/008/009 entities updated\n- DOB-015 (LLMConfig data object) + serving connection to APP-005\n- Component map diagram updated (v0.3.0)\n- general_python_coding_guidelines.md: src/agents/ adapter-layer note\n\nDemo (all features):\n- 4-step flow: scaffold → infra check → agent run → verify\n- Framework infrastructure check: EventStore, agent registry (all 9 roles),\n  LearningStore, SDLCGraphState, PMDecision — all pass without LLM key\n\nAll 119 tests pass; ModelVerifier 0 errors (2050 files)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"304952dc30c0ea8460131dd23e1f1809a6360f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/304952dc30c0ea8460131dd23e1f1809a6360f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKGE1OGU4ZDU5MDgwZTRhNjEwZTU5NjQ1ODIwMzA2ODIyMGExMzFjYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/ea13b16b363c182474a128f2473d8de6b96f580d","sha":"ea13b16b363c182474a128f2473d8de6b96f580d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/ea13b16b363c182474a128f2473d8de6b96f580d"}],"sha":"a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/a58e8d59080e4a610e596458203068220a131cc2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/ea13b16b363c182474a128f2473d8de6b96f580d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T20:22:25Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T20:22:25Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"feat: Stage 5 MVP + 5.6-A LLM provider configuration\n\nImplements the full Stage 5 MVP (Python runtime layer) and Stage 5.6-A\n(structured LLM provider configuration), plus all uncommitted Stage 4.9j\nskill-file additions.\n\n## Stage 5 MVP (src/agents/, src/orchestration/, src/events/)\n\n- src/agents/base.py: build_agent() factory (Layer 1+2+3 system prompt\n  assembly, SkillLoader wired as @agent.system_prompt callback)\n- src/agents/deps.py: AgentDeps dataclass (engagement_id, event_store,\n  active_skill_id, workflow_state, paths, agent_id)\n- src/agents/skill_loader.py: SkillLoader with budget-enforced extraction\n  (simple≤600/standard≤1200/complex≤2000 tokens, hard-stop + warning)\n- src/agents/tools/: universal_tools (file I/O, artifact read), escalation_tools\n  (algedonic signal + CQ raise), learning_tools (query + write_learning),\n  write_tools (path-boundary enforcement, ALG-007 on violation)\n- src/events/replay.py: updated; replay_builder.py: full 20-event state machine\n- src/orchestration/graph_state.py: SDLCGraphState TypedDict\n- src/orchestration/session.py: EngagementSession MVP — boot, config load,\n  EventStore init, invoke_specialist(); CLI: python -m src.orchestration.session\n\n## Stage 5.6-A — LLM Provider Configuration\n\n- src/models/llm_config.py: LLMConfig Pydantic model; cascade load: per-engagement\n  YAML llm: block → global YAML llm: block → SDLC_PRIMARY_MODEL/SDLC_ROUTING_MODEL\n  env vars → compiled-in defaults. Supports any PydanticAI provider:model-id string.\n- src/models/__init__.py: package init\n- src/agents/base.py: build_agent() accepts llm_config: LLMConfig | None\n- src/orchestration/session.py: replaced os.getenv(\"SDLC_MODEL\") with LLMConfig.load()\n- pyproject.toml: anthropic moved to [anthropic] optional extra; [openai] and [ollama]\n  extras added; PydanticAI stays core\n- engagements-config.yaml: top-level llm: block with primary-model/routing-model\n- scripts/demo_setup.py: --model flag sets SDLC_PRIMARY_MODEL env var\n\n## Demo/Integration Test Scripts (scripts/)\n\n- demo_setup.py: scaffold + run SA agent (SA-PHASE-A) + verify (7 checks)\n- demo_teardown.py: remove ENG-DEMO engagement + config entry\n- demo_scaffold.py / demo_verify.py / _demo_taskflow.py: supporting modules\n- add_step0m_and_memory_close.py: bulk script that added Step 0.M to all skill files\n\n## Stage 4.9j — Skill file Step 0.M additions (50 skill files)\n\nAll agent skill files now include Step 0.M (Memento Recall) in the Discovery Scan\nand End-of-Skill Memory Close per discovery-protocol.md v1.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84ec8d20ad0d142dc67380f7d711a608d66644f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/84ec8d20ad0d142dc67380f7d711a608d66644f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/ea13b16b363c182474a128f2473d8de6b96f580d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c