backend, tool contract);\n  explicit design rationale for single-tool approach (no separate skill-amendment tool)\n- agent-runtime-spec.md §6.1: four PydanticAI memory tool rows\n  (query_learnings, record_learning, get_memento_state, save_memento_state)\n- tool-catalog.md §6: new Agent PydanticAI Memory Tools section\n\nENG-001 model (+3 entities, +4 connections):\n- DOB-014 MementoState (data-object): ephemeral per-agent per-phase scratchpad,\n  overwrite semantics, ≤250 tokens\n- APP-023 MementoStore (application-component): LangGraph BaseStore wrapper,\n  overwrite namespace, shares workflow.db with LearningStore\n- AIF-007 MementoPort (application-interface): exposes get/save_memento_state\n- Connections: APP-023→AIF-007 serving, APP-023→DOB-014 access,\n  APP-023→APP-003 association, APP-003→AIF-006 serving (AIF-006 orphan fix)\n\nDiagrams:\n- specialist-invocation-cycle v0.3.0: adds Step 0 Discovery Scan group\n  (query_learnings ×2 + get_memento_state) and End-of-Skill Memory Close group\n- Technology sequence diagrams renamed/split for scope clarity; bootstrap,\n  snapshot-policy, observability-query, and replay-hydration views updated/added\n\nStage 5 deferred items recorded: src/agents/memento_store.py,\nquery_learnings() skill_id/entry_type extension, universal_tools.py memory\ntools, learning-entry.schema.md update\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16ba582501faa3e809b352e2d2cb806ac19e7f1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/16ba582501faa3e809b352e2d2cb806ac19e7f1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/ed183fa876c9097b8044377621512efbaa4fff7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.