dmin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/795d0317670439eef7bc2f628ed44c8153fd2659/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T17:46:46Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T17:46:46Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Stage 4.9f: two new diagrams, ACO+AIA pattern, E306/E307 draft-reference checks\n\nENG-001 model (4.9f — 4/7 diagrams now complete):\n- New: phase-b-activity-sprint-v1.puml (sprint lifecycle BPMN, 3 swimlanes)\n- New: phase-c-class-er-v1.puml (persisted domain objects ER, DOB-001..011)\n- Updated: phase-b-archimate-business-v1.puml → v0.4.0 (BPR-005→BSV-004,\n  ACT-003/004→BPR-008 assignment connections)\n- New entities: ACO-001 (ApplicationCollaboration), AIA-001 (ApplicationInteraction)\n- New/deleted connections: ACO+AIA collaboration→interaction pattern replaces\n  incorrect individual ASV→BPR realization; DOB-007---DOB-007 self-ref deleted;\n  DOB-009---DOB-005 added; 9 additional cross-layer connections\n- ER alias fix: DOB-NNN aliases now use underscores (DOB_NNN) throughout;\n  diagram-conventions.md §7.er template corrected to match\n- Rendered: all 4 diagrams to rendered/ as SVG\n\nsrc/common/model_verifier.py:\n- ModelRegistry: entity_status(id)/connection_status(id) targeted single-file\n  lookups (O(1) cache hit; O(n) targeted walk on cold miss); entity_statuses()/\n  connection_statuses() bulk API; single meta-dict per domain eliminates\n  duplicate scans\n- E306: baselined diagram references draft entity\n- E307: baselined diagram references draft connection\n- Both suppressed for draft diagrams (draft→draft-element allowed in-sprint)\n- 2 new BDD scenarios; 71 tests passing\n\nframework/diagram-conventions.md:\n- §11.6: replaced absolute \"no draft in diagrams\" rule with correct\n  draft-diagram/baselined-diagram status consistency rule (E306/E307)\n- §3 alias constraint updated to match; §7.er template corrected\n- §7.activity: collective swimlane abstraction note (generic)\n\nframework/agent-runtime-spec.md: status table corrected (draft elements\n  permitted in draft diagrams)\n\nagents/sa/phase-b.md, agents/swa/phase-c-application.md: ACO+AIA pattern\n  documented to prevent recurrence\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e7927631bc2a8710c3bf9e079ee044a080c2188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/7e7927631bc2a8710c3bf9e079ee044a080c2188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/795d0317670439eef7bc2f628ed44c8153fd2659","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":