pository query engine + domain vocabulary\n\nsrc/common/model_query.py — ModelRepository with:\n  - list_entities/connections/diagrams(**filter) metadata filtering\n  - list_artifacts(**filter) / search_artifacts(query) / read_artifact(id, mode)\n    framework-aligned API (discovery-protocol.md §1.2–§1.3)\n  - Keyword search with TF-IDF scoring over name, type, layer, content_text,\n    display_label/alias, and extra frontmatter fields\n  - SemanticSearchProvider Protocol hook for future sqlite-vec embedding tier\n  - find_connections_for(entity_id, direction) / find_neighbors(entity_id, max_hops)\n    graph traversal\n  - ArtifactSummary lightweight metadata record (no body text)\n  - CLI: python -m src.common.model_query <stats|entities|connections|diagrams|get|graph|search>\n\nsrc/common/domain_vocabulary.py — canonical SDLC/ArchiMate domain vocabulary:\n  - Bidirectional synonym map (agent abbreviations, protocol terms, ArchiMate\n    prefix→type, common domain concepts)\n  - expand_tokens() for one-hop synonym expansion used by search scoring\n  - agent_abbreviations() and archimate_prefix_to_type() lookup tables\n  - Shared resource for model_query, LearningStore, and future NLP pipelines\n\ntests/model/features/model_query.feature + tests/model/test_model_query.py:\n  - 36 BDD scenarios covering filter, lookup, graph traversal, list_artifacts,\n    read_artifact, search, synonym expansion, and stats\n\nCLAUDE.md / README.md / specs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md updated to reflect new modules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e29134345d1ef925c924f1c3741190ca5fbf56cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/e29134345d1ef925c924f1c3741190ca5fbf56cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/dadc6bafafa49ed9cad4d0f06a77fa86172f5ae0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":