 IDs in diagram\n\nDiagram cross-verification:\n- README diagram-types section: all 5 types as complementary+overlapping, not exclusive;\n  activity diagrams clarified for business-layer and application-layer scopes\n- diagram-conventions.md: new cross-verification table + consistency rule; §7 updated\n  with business-layer vs application-layer activity diagram templates and rules; v2.2.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5be0ceb3e9705e790009ec13c8bc3b53c161bf0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/5be0ceb3e9705e790009ec13c8bc3b53c161bf0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/f52f7d92dea7f4971bf812cab0ba1e49a5ab2844","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/f52f7d92dea7f4971bf812cab0ba1e49a5ab2844","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKGY1MmY3ZDkyZGVhN2Y0OTcxYmY4MTJjYWIwYmExZTQ5YTVhYjI4NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/76e813bd8e7c603c8842c6fea08264abdc55140f","sha":"76e813bd8e7c603c8842c6fea08264abdc55140f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/76e813bd8e7c603c8842c6fea08264abdc55140f"}],"sha":"f52f7d92dea7f4971bf812cab0ba1e49a5ab2844","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/f52f7d92dea7f4971bf812cab0ba1e49a5ab2844"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/76e813bd8e7c603c8842c6fea08264abdc55140f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T12:24:36Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T12:24:36Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Stage 4.9f: neutral <<Grouping>>, checklist update, README sync\n\nGrouping stereotypes:\n- Restore <<Grouping>> (white/neutral) for heterogeneous or purely\n  organisational containers that span multiple ArchiMate layers\n- diagram-conventions §11.3: updated rule — use layer-specific stereotype\n  for homogeneous groups; <<Grouping>> for heterogeneous; prohibition on\n  inline #color overrides applies to both\n- entity-conventions §3.3: grouping table updated to show both options\n- archimate_types.py: ARCHIMATE_GROUPING_STEREOTYPES now includes Grouping\n- _archimate-stereotypes.puml: <<Grouping>> re-added (white bg, grey border)\n\nCLAUDE.md end-of-session checklist:\n- Renamed to 4 items (was 3); added explicit model verification step:\n  run ModelVerifier.verify_all(), re-render modified diagrams, commit SVGs\n\nREADME.md sync:\n- Implementation Status table updated: entity count, connection count (89),\n  diagram status with semantic corrections noted, archimate_types.py and\n  generate_macros.py entries added, puml-bug-reports.md entry added\n- Architecture entity directory structure note updated (roles/, collaborations/)\n- Canonical type registry reference added to Work Repositories section\n- ArchiMate diagram conventions summary added below the status table\n\nModel verification: 190 files, 0 errors. Both diagrams re-rendered cleanly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e67eff3a22eea5041fdef60ad5aacb5940282aa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/e67eff3a22eea5041fdef60ad5aacb5940282aa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/76e813bd8e7c603c8842c6fea08264abdc55140f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gra