cjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/4e2c9abd4706a4e79659173ce137867685618bf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T12:11:54Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T12:11:54Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Stage 4.9f: ArchiMate semantic corrections + canonical type registry\n\nEntity type corrections (model-first discipline):\n- ACT-002..ACT-010: BusinessActor → BusinessRole (agents define role\n  specifications; application-layer ApplicationComponents fill those roles)\n- ACT-011 (Architecture Board): BusinessActor → BusinessCollaboration\n  (joint governance body of SA Role + SwA Role + User)\n- Moved entity files to semantic subdirs: business/roles/, business/collaborations/\n- ACT-001 (User) remains BusinessActor — human entity, not role specification\n\nPhase-B diagram (v0.2.0):\n- Groups renamed: \"AI Agents\" → \"AI Agent Roles\"; new \"Architecture Governance\"\n- <<Grouping>> stereotype added to all outer containers\n- 8 BPR→BSV realization connections added (BSV island eliminated)\n- 14 new BPR→BSV connection files in connections/archimate/realization/\n\nPhase-C diagram (v0.2.0):\n- <<Grouping>> stereotype added to all 5 outer containers\n- Cross-layer boundary elements declared outside groups (BSV_001..009, ACT_001)\n- 4 APP→BSV cross-layer realization arrows added (APP-007/008/009/020→BSV)\n- APP_020→ACT_001 serving connection drawn\n\nCanonical type registry (new):\n- src/common/archimate_types.py: single source of truth for all valid\n  artifact-type (entity + connection), element-type, relationship-type values\n- Organised by ArchiMate layer (entities) and diagram language (connections)\n- business-collaboration added; entity/connection types complete through PhysicalLayer\n- model_verifier.py now imports ALL_ENTITY_TYPES and ALL_CONNECTION_TYPES from it\n- entity-conventions.md §3.3: full type tables + canonical registry reference\n- diagram-conventions.md §6: references registry for element-type values\n\nFramework updates:\n- diagram-conventions.md §10: fixed §10.3/§10.4 numbering inversion\n- diagram-conventions.md §11: new ArchiMate semantic constraints section\n  (layer boundaries, active structure types, grouping stereotypes, BSV realization)\n  — examples use generic IDs, no ENG-001 specifics\n- _archimate-stereotypes.puml: <<Grouping>> stereotype added\n- entity-conventions.md: business-collaboration template added;\n  app-component/app-service/app-interface corrected to application-* names\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a145d44ad4fe1c89998fe6c3e11fc2d977f371e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/a145d44ad4fe1c89998fe6c3e11fc2d977f371e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/4e2c9abd4706a4e79659173ce137867685618bf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83",