il.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T08:53:03Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Stage 4.8h: SA/SwA role boundary refactoring — complete\n\nArchiMate layer boundary is now the role boundary. SA owns\nmotivation/strategy/business layers; SwA owns application/technology\nlayers.\n\nKey changes:\n- Phase C primary moved to SwA: new SwA-PHASE-C-APP and SwA-PHASE-C-DATA\n  skill files; SA phase-c skills converted to consulting traceability\n  review (SA-PHASE-C-APP-REVIEW, SA-PHASE-C-DATA-REVIEW)\n- SA AGENT.md v1.1.0: primary-phases [A,B,H]; consulting-phases [C,D-G]\n- SwA AGENT.md v1.1.0: primary-phases [C,D,E,F,G,H]; entry-points include EP-C\n- Phase H split: SA produces business-layer CR, always routes\n  phase-h-application-technology-track handoff to SwA; SwA produces\n  application/technology-layer CR (SwA-PHASE-H v1.1.0, complexity: complex)\n- SA phase-h.md v1.1.0: scoped to motivation/strategy/business layer only\n- C→D gate: SwA casts vote; SA provides consulting acknowledgement only\n- framework/agent-index.md v1.2.0: Phase C/H routing updated\n- framework/agile-adm-cadence.md: Phase C primary=SwA; §4.1 owners updated;\n  AA/DA artifact ontology owner corrected\n- framework/raci-matrix.md: Phase C/H rows updated; C→D gate SA G→○\n- framework/repository-conventions.md §2.2: write-authority by layer\n- framework/artifact-registry-design.md §4.4: app-layer owners SA→SwA\n- framework/discovery-protocol.md: role-specific scan priority note\n- framework/sdlc-entry-points.md: EP-C/EP-G AA/DA producer SA→SwA\n- framework/artifact-schemas: AA/DA owner updated to SwA\n- framework/entity-conventions.md: APP-001/DOB-001 exemplars corrected\n- framework/agent-runtime-spec.md: skill ID example updated\n- SA phase-b.md: handoff to SwA added to outputs\n- CLAUDE.md: end-of-session checklist added; stage table updated\n- README.md: agent roles, work repos, Phase H description updated\n\nCo-