r_content, generate_er_relations, validate_diagram, render_diagram)\n- diagram-conventions.md v2.1.0: PUML header comment frontmatter; templates/ not index.yaml; D3d/D5 updated; reading vs. rendering clarified\n- artifact-registry-design.md v2.1.0: model-entities/ siblings layout; §2.3-2.4 added\n\nRetroactive skill file updates: SA phase-b/c and SwA phase-d/e diagram steps updated\nto D1-D4 protocol with list_artifacts/search_artifacts.\n\nSwA AGENT.md: cross-layer diagram scope stated; ERP v2.0 repository paths; §12 Step 0.D updated.\n\nIMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md: Stage 4.8d marked complete; Stage 4.8h added — SA/SwA role\nboundary refactoring (SA = Motivation+Strategy+Business layers; SwA = Application+Technology\nlayers). Stage 4.9 blocked on 4.8h. Full rework checklist and open design decisions recorded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c001b5624b71122a554f4fe072f01b11c769a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/3c001b5624b71122a554f4fe072f01b11c769a69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/0669d29065bbad545fb4de6c36924865bb4703f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"star