reply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5f519234ebcf3887f96e514188c9a93fe6ac322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/a5f519234ebcf3887f96e514188c9a93fe6ac322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/d8a832cbe70c51358b8174854edfb228f7b91d1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/d8a832cbe70c51358b8174854edfb228f7b91d1c","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKGQ4YTgzMmNiZTcwYzUxMzU4YjgxNzQ4NTRlZGZiMjI4ZjdiOTFkMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313","sha":"31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313"}],"sha":"d8a832cbe70c51358b8174854edfb228f7b91d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/d8a832cbe70c51358b8174854edfb228f7b91d1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T19:56:29Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T19:56:29Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Add semantic search / filtering to work-repository discovery; fix discovery protocol\n\nCore change: work-repository discovery is tool-mediated (list_artifacts + search_artifacts),\nnever a directory walk. External sources (Layer 3) are situative only.\n\nframework/discovery-protocol.md:\n- Layer 1: rewritten — all access via AgentDeps (engagement context), list_artifacts(**filter),\n  search_artifacts(query) for concept-based lookup, query_events for interaction history;\n  explicit prohibition on directory enumeration\n- Layer 2: rewritten — list_artifacts(engagement=\"enterprise\", ...) + search_artifacts for\n  cross-type enterprise concept search; no directory listing\n- Layer 3 governing principle: fixed — Layers 1/2/4 are \"always queried via tool interfaces\n  (filtered and ranked; never full directory walks)\"; Layer 3 situative only\n\nspecs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md:\n- APP-002 ModelRegistry: two-tier index — in-memory frontmatter cache + SQLite FTS5 full-text\n  index over §content blocks + optional sqlite-vec semantic tier; search(query, **filter)\n  returns ranked (ArtifactRecord, snippet) pairs; model_registry.db git-tracked\n- AIF-004 ArtifactReadWriterPort: add search(query, **filter) method\n- universal_tools.py: add search_artifacts(query, **filter) as primary content-discovery tool;\n  clarify list_artifacts as metadata-filter tool; annotate search_artifacts as preferred when\n  artifact type uncertain or discovery is by concept\n- Stage 5b ModelRegistry checklist item: FTS5 table + sqlite-vec optional tier\n- Stage 4.8d discovery-protocol.md item: updated to include search_artifacts\n\nREADME.md: work-repositories queried via list_artifacts + search_artifacts + ModelRegistry tiers\nCLAUDE.md Rule 12: discovery uses list_artifacts + search_artifacts, not directory walks;\n  Layer 3 situative only\nexternal-sources/: add engagement-scope field to Confluence example; add Jira and git examples\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b8571b442f6723d439f38d2e2ef27f6b3e3ca57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/8b8571b442f6723d439f38d2e2ef27f6b3e3ca57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKDMxMjEyY2YzNDNkMDQ4MmIzZjM1ZDQwMjUyMDQyMGJhODhjZTUzMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/a825436d7a6875813fd294ccfe3ab1bad6dd207c","sha":"a825436d7a6875813fd294ccfe3ab1bad6dd207c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/a825436d7a6875813fd294ccfe3ab1bad6dd207c"}],"sha":"31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/31212cf343d0482b3f35d402520420ba88ce5313"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/a825436d7a6875813fd294ccfe3ab1bad6dd207c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T19:22:59Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T19:22:59Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Add README.md: project introduction, conceptual foundations, agent roles, workflows, configuration, repositories, diagram types\n\nCovers: goals; TOGAF ADM + Agile ADM cadence; VSM (Beer), contingency theory (Lawrence & Lorsch, Galbraith), STAMP/STPA; nine agent roles with VSM positions and primary phases; skills and ADM phase alignment; forward SDLC, brownfield EP-G, and change management workflows; engagements-config.yaml and enterprise-repository-config.yaml; work-repository ownership table; target-repository worktree model; event-sourcing and three-layer emitter hierarchy; dashboard interaction surface; five PlantUML diagram families (ArchiMate layers, ER/class, activity/BPMN, sequence, use-case); further reading index.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b682fb5b61579e7043767d76dafe3fc4eeea7330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/b682fb5b61579e7043767d76dafe3fc4eeea7330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/a825436d7a6875813fd294ccfe3ab1bad6dd207c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_ur