"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/8a0bd46fe0522bb93217f5f09cfe7c4b075366ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T19:10:31Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T19:10:31Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Add three-layer event emitter hierarchy and complete workflow event taxonomy\n\nResolves the question of who emits workflow-level events above individual tool calls.\n\nspecs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md:\n- APP-016 LangGraph Orchestrator: nodes receive event_store directly; per-node lifecycle event responsibilities documented (sprint_close_node, gate_check_node, cq_user_node, algedonic_handler_node, review_processing_node, engagement_complete_node)\n- APP-017 EngagementSession: emits engagement.started + snapshot on bootstrap; emits sprint.started on first specialist of each sprint; uses replay_from_latest_snapshot()\n- pm_tools.py: each tool''s emitted event documented (specialist.invoked, gate.evaluated+snapshot, cq.batched, decision.recorded, review.pending)\n- Stage 5c nodes.py: per-node event responsibilities with full list; event_store injection via functools.partial or config\n- Stage 5c session.py: engagement.started + sprint.started emission documented\n- Stage 5a: new workflow lifecycle event taxonomy table (17 event types, emitter, WorkflowState update)\n- Key decisions: three-layer emitter hierarchy documented as decided design\n\nCLA