 WorkflowState: snapshot payload; registered_uploads, upload_reference_map, snapshot_sequence fields added; JSON-serialisability constraint\n- Stage 5a: full snapshot implementation checklist (situative triggers + periodic every 100 events + EngagementSession startup sequence)\n- §4.9h: rewritten — all events emitted at tool layer, not skill instructions; source_evidence auto-extraction explained; entity.confirmed payload simplified; contingency note for future skill additions\n- Stage 4.8g (new): planned skill/agent alignment audit with explicit checklist and outcome options per finding\n- Key decisions: snapshot mandate entry added\n- Current State: updated to 4.8d → 4.8g → 4.9 → Stage 5\n\nCLAUDE.md:\n- Rule 22 updated: tool-transparent emission, no skill changes required, snapshot mandate included\n- Stage 4.8 status: 4.8d + 4.8g pending\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"04bbf93e0cec2f1401b521426640fb2dbab171c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/04bbf93e0cec2f1401b521426640fb2dbab171c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/162ae563f620e3160f76af61fae3a70309bf5930","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mba