comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:48:34Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T18:48:34Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Add model-evolution + event-sourcing invariants to Stage 4.9/5a plan and CLAUDE.md\n\nspecs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md:\n- Stage 4.9 preamble: explicit ''model evolution is expected and normal'' callout — entity/connection/diagram files are living specs that change alongside Stage 5; model-first applies in both forward and reverse directions\n- New §4.9h: Event-Sourcing of Repository Mutations and User Inputs — full event taxonomy (artifact.created/updated, source.scanned, entity.confirmed, upload.registered, file.referenced) with payload contract table, reverse-arch skill contract, and model-update contract\n- Stage 5a: add checklist item for the §4.9h event taxonomy implementation in src/events/models.py + replay.py, with WorkflowState update column per type\n- Key decisions: two new entries capturing these as decided policy\n\nCLAUDE.md:\n- Rule 21: Stage 4.9 entities are living specs — model-first applies both forward and in reverse architecture\n- Rule 22: Every engagement repo mutation must be event-sourced; references §4.9h for full taxonomy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d97dc4d5451dd0fa554a1cc62142c096a0bb833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/1d97dc4d5451dd0fa554a1cc62142c096a0bb833"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/e44e423e065fba9e9a924060d6f49f4edad8edc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followe