m/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/30b1de87bdd9d5c0f31887b1d2c0f251d79109fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T17:35:39Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T17:35:39Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Complete Stage 4.8a–c/e: ERP v2.0 framework (entity registry, diagram conventions, promotion design)\n\nCore ERP v2.0 design:\n- framework/artifact-registry-design.md (new): ModelRegistry replaces _index.yaml; ArchiMate-organised\n  entity directories; §content/§display file format; connection type registry; model-first rule;\n  two-scope ID spaces (engagement-local vs enterprise-global from id-counters.yaml); promote_entity\n  performs reference sweep then moves file; Architecture Board members are the only enterprise-repo writers\n- framework/artifact-schemas/entity-conventions.md (new): unified frontmatter (no references/diagram-element-id);\n  §content/§display with ### language H3 subsections; properties tables per ArchiMate type; five exemplars\n- framework/diagram-conventions.md: no elements/ subdir; _macros.puml from §display blocks; artifact-ids\n  as PUML aliases; D1–D5 protocol; entry_type: local|reference in diagrams/index.yaml;\n  existing diagrams referenced in-place, never copied; bootstrap has no entity import step; promote_diagram moves\n- framework/repository-conventions.md §12: promotion is move not copy; ID reassignment via id-counters.yaml;\n  promote_entity reference sweep; Architecture Board only; §12.3 extended with model-entity types\n\nSupporting updates:\n- framework/artifact-schemas/repository-map.schema.md (new): multi-repo engagement repository map\n- framework/discovery-protocol.md, learning-protocol.md: stage 4.7/4.6d updates (previously uncommitted)\n- engagements-config.yaml, .gitignore: multi-repo and worktree support (previously uncommitted)\n- CLAUDE.md: repository layout updated to ERP v2.0; authoring rules #8/#16 rewritten; stages table updated\n- specs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md: 4.8a–c notes expanded with ID-space and diagram-referencing design decisions\n- memory/: project_state.md and MEMORY.md updated to reflect current stage and next tasks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5698aea1cebea31d8b5148ca00bab875b1f4c9d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/5698aea1cebea31d8b5148ca00bab875b1f4c9d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/30b1de87bdd9d5c0f31887b1d2c0f251d79109fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83","id":14870288,"login":"mbauer83","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODcwMjg4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commit/30b1de87bdd9d5c0f31887b1d2c0f251d79109fc","node_id":"C_kwDOR4KqItoAKDMwYjFkZTg3YmRkOWQ1YzBmMzE4ODdiMWQyYzBmMjUxZDc5MTA5ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbaue