kill-id, trigger-phases (machine-\n  readable routing key), trigger-conditions (LLM-hint prose), primary-outputs\n- framework/agent-index.md: compact ~500-token routing reference covering all\n  agents, all skills, and the phase-to-agent activation map\n- CLAUDE.md authoring rule #14\n\n## Runtime architecture\n- framework/agent-runtime-spec.md: PydanticAI 4-layer system prompt assembly\n  (identity → personality → active skill → artifact context), SkillLoader\n  protocol, AgentDeps dataclass, tool sets per agent, agent-as-tool invocation\n  pattern, token budget guidelines\n- framework/orchestration-topology.md: LangGraph graph topology (SDLCGraphState,\n  PM supervisor node, specialist nodes, conditional routing, algedonic bypass),\n  EventStore as cross-session state, Phase G parallelism tradeoffs\n- Stage 5 in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN fully detailed: 5 sub-stages with concrete\n  src/ file names, class shapes, and spec references\n- CLAUDE.md authoring rule #15\n\n## Stage 5.5 dashboard planned\n- IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN: FastAPI local web server (src/dashboard/), 9 views,\n  read-only, no auth, no JS framework\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9538696c13fa36df6d67acc8c8b11ed8afa337b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/9538696c13fa36df6d67acc8c8b11ed8afa337b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/90d56f5d9453483be867687ce2a9e9c5c02d0c4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://githu