CQ lifecycle: batching, routing, tracking, resumption, ALG-016\n- Algedonic signal routing for all 18 triggers\n- Phase revisit detection, visit count enforcement (3-visit limit)\n\nagents/project-manager/skills/phase-a.md:\n- EP-0 Scoping Interview procedure and Entry Assessment Report delivery\n- Non-EP-0 warm-start AV coordination\n- Phase A gate checklist and SoAW co-production\n\nagents/project-manager/skills/phase-e-f.md:\n- Work Package Catalog (PM accountable), Risk Register, Architecture Roadmap\n- Implementation Plan (PM accountable), Solution Sprint Plan\n- Phase E and F gate checklists\n\nagents/project-manager/skills/phase-g.md:\n- Per-sprint governance: AC verification, compliance assessment coordination\n- Governance Checkpoint Records format\n- Phase G exit conditions and gate\n\nagents/project-manager/skills/phase-h.md:\n- Change Record intake and classification (Minor/Significant/Major/Emergency)\n- Phase return coordination with EventStore phase.return-triggered\n- Visit count enforcement; emergency change procedure\n\nagents/project-manager/skills/retrospective-knowledge-capture.md:\n- Sprint and engagement retrospective procedures\n- Enterprise Promotion Review (Promotion Request format)\n- Knowledge Base structure and stewardship\n\nSprint: stage-2\nAgent: project-manager\nGate: Stage 2 complete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c46e31177b5c31115a3b5208c06f78da60c4f30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/trees/7c46e31177b5c31115a3b5208c06f78da60c4f30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/git/commits/13b59dc36f188d1e95ff61e8e511628c533a0677","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14870288?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/