github.com/users/mbauer83/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbauer83","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-multi-agent-system/commits/3ac032acb77d95a5abe367f419f8f2955d08f74e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T17:06:59Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T17:06:59Z","email":"mbauer.mphil@googlemail.com","name":"Michael Bauer"},"message":"Stage 1 foundation: framework, schemas, EventStore skeleton, directory structure\n\nAll Stage 1 deliverables:\n- framework/: agile-adm-cadence.md, raci-matrix.md, repository-conventions.md,\n  algedonic-protocol.md, clarification-protocol.md, sdlc-entry-points.md,\n  architecture-repository-design.md, artifact-schemas/ (11 schema files)\n- enterprise-repository/ directory structure (9 TOGAF component subdirs)\n- engagements/ENG-001/ with all work-repositories, event logs, clarification-log,\n  handoff-log, algedonic-log; engagement-profile.md\n- external-sources/ with example Confluence adapter config\n- src/events/: EventStore class, Pydantic v2 event models, registry, replay/export stubs\n- enterprise-repository-config.yaml, engagements-config.yaml (with target-repository)\n- .gitignore: workflow.db is git-tracked (canonical); target-repo/ excluded\n\nSQLite is the canonical event store (Pydantic-validated, ACID, append-only enforced).\nYAML workflow-events/ are human-readable projections committed at sprint close.\n\nSprint: AS-0\nAgent: system\nGate: Stage 1 complete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c79061048ec2e8f71308c9341f121890f800778","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbauer83/sdlc-mu