me":"vtrv101"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T04:31:22Z","email":"vtrv101@gmail.com","name":"vtrv101"},"message":"Address review findings: remote resilience, 401 refresh, deep-link preservation\n\n- lazyRemote helper: retries + timeout for federated imports (plain lazy()\n  caches a rejected import for the whole SPA session); all remote pages\n  use it, and RemoteBoundary gains a Try-again reload button.\n- useServiceApi clients get the deduped 401-refresh-retry interceptor —\n  a user idling past token TTL on a federated page no longer dead-ends.\n- Guard preserves the requested location through the login round-trip\n  (verified live: logged-out /patient/record -> login -> /patient/record);\n  boundary label renamed to Health Profile.\n- Sidebar: aria-disabled + Coming-soon tooltips on disabled items;\n  comments document which disabled targets lack routes.\n- README tree drops the deleted profile page; TODO captures the stranded\n  patient_profile data decision; JWKS test no longer depends on local .env.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9c867d5a59a5d2462cdd01d86bdf62ec6548edf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/phr/git/trees/a9c867d5a59a5d2462cdd01d86bdf62ec6548edf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/phr/git/commits/00742fc1570b394e1dd3e5108cab14324f90f633","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25243?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vtrv101","id":25243,"login":"vtrv101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vt