thub.com/users/Awais68/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commits/d1471f44d7acef3d3bc71e12f6fd239b29ec354d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:35:11Z","email":"hamzajii768@gmail.com","name":"Awais68"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T17:35:11Z","email":"hamzajii768@gmail.com","name":"Awais68"},"message":"fix(frontend): recover from stale chunks after a deploy\n\nOpen tabs kept the old index.html and failed with ''Failed to fetch\ndynamically imported module'' once the new build replaced its chunks.\n\n- main.jsx: reload on vite:preloadError, at most once per 10s\n- vercel.json: no-cache on HTML, immutable on /assets/*\n- /assets/* is no longer rewritten to index.html, so a missing chunk 404s\n  instead of being served (and cached for a year) as HTML\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b81b034f4ddb0c2fa149825dd114737598ba2928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/git/trees/b81b034f4ddb0c2fa149825dd114737598ba2928"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/git/commits/d1471f44d7acef3d3bc71e12f6fd239b29ec354d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161300531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Awais68","id":161300531,"login":"Awais68","node_id":"U_kgDOCZ1AMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user