followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Awais68","id":161300531,"login":"Awais68","node_id":"U_kgDOCZ1AMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commits/0c60c2896869ca26409db0bfc6afe6e01b1af575/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:09:14Z","email":"hamzajii768@gmail.com","name":"Awais68"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T19:09:14Z","email":"hamzajii768@gmail.com","name":"Awais68"},"message":"fix: route live chat through DeepSeek, trim chat context, ship server/ on deploy\n\n- The /api/chat route loads the root server/chatbotService.js; the DeepSeek\n  wiring had gone into vault-control/server/chatbotService.js, which nothing\n  imports (now removed). DeepSeek is now first off-peak and last or dropped in\n  peak per DEEPSEEK_PEAK_POLICY, with thinking disabled. Key prefix no longer\n  logged.\n- Chat context cut from ~30.8k to ~15k chars: draft/post/notification/email\n  text is previewed and the JSON is compact. Groq fallback was 413ing at\n  10.9k tokens against its 8k TPM limit.\n- Deploy workflow never shipped root server/, so chatbot changes never\n  reached the VM. Added it to the tarball, trigger paths and syntax check.\n- Login page: show/hide password toggle.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8458d3f637aac8035b0cc8a700683cb26905b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/git/trees/e8458d3f637aac8035b0cc8a700683cb26905b07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/git/commits/0c60c2896869ca26409db0bfc6afe6e01b1af575","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161300531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Awais68","id":161300531,"login":"Awais68","node_id":"U_kgDOCZ1AMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commit/0c60c2896869ca26409db0bfc6afe6e01b1af575","node_id":"C_kwDOR4Pv49oAKDBjNjBjMjg5Njg2OWNhMjY0MDlkYjBiZmM2YWZlNmUwMWIxYWY1NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commit/fc1db0b7cd9270ec5471af275b0c8e06047ae394","sha":"fc1db0b7cd9270ec5471af275b0c8e06047ae394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commits/fc1db0b7cd9270ec5471af275b0c8e06047ae394"}],"sha":"0c60c2896869ca26409db0bfc6afe6e01b1af575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commits/0c60c2896869ca26409db0bfc6afe6e01b1af575"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161300531?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Awais68","id":161300531,"login":"Awais68","node_id":"U_kgDOCZ1AMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Awais68","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/commits/fc1db0b7cd9270ec5471af275b0c8e06047ae394/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:07:21Z","email":"hamzajii768@gmail.com","name":"Awais68"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T18:07:21Z","email":"hamzajii768@gmail.com","name":"Awais68"},"message":"feat: DeepSeek as primary LLM with strict peak-hours rule\n\n- DeepSeek (deepseek-flash) is the first provider in llm_router,\n  provider_config and vault-control callAI.\n- Peak (2x price, Mon-Fri 09-12 and 14-18 Beijing) moves DeepSeek to last\n  resort or blocks it per DEEPSEEK_PEAK_POLICY; weekends and Chinese\n  holidays in deepseek_calendar.json are off-peak. Rules in peak-hours.md.\n- Reasoning disabled by default (DEEPSEEK_THINKING): it cost 2-3x output\n  tokens and returned empty content with small max_tokens.\n- Chatbot no longer logs a key prefix.\n- Deploy tarball ships the calendar and rules file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fd987a99865831ed7000385cccb494bb001f4db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Awais68/Digital_Employee/g