react-router-dom in webpack — config now mirrors the shared-config.json\n    (eager without singleton) that causes the 84/100 score\n  - scenarios/3-federation-issues/apps/catalog: drop the stale ''^6.20.0''\n    hardcode for react-router-dom; use deps[''react-router-dom''] to match\n    shared-config.json — that downgrade was noise, not part of the demo story\n  - scenarios/1-healthy/apps/catalog: fix misleading comment (lodash is not\n    in SHARE_CANDIDATE_PACKAGES so the score does not change between depths)\n\nREADME: add \"How the Simulation Works\" section explaining the shared-config\nmirror pattern, single node_modules simplification, the async bootstrap\nrequirement, and TypeScript declaration files for federated modules","tree":{"sha":"4d218683cd92576017a7e0c122a137d335afcfe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/mf-storefront-demo/git/trees/4d218683cd92576017a7e0c122a137d335afcfe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/mf-storefront-demo/git/commits/b03ed8bb114ec58297fada9f2368dd5c7cf257c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51998458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zvitaly7","id":51998458,"login":"zvitaly7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk4NDU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/subscriptions","