com","name":"Vitaly Zheltko"},"message":"feat: add scenario 4 (critical), depth comparison, and CI gate demo\n\nThree stress-case additions:\n\nScenario 4 — Critical: Every shared config declares stale major\nversions (react 16, react-dom 16, react-router v5, zustand v3) against\nan 18/6/4 stack. Scores: shell 20, catalog 1, checkout 4 — all CRITICAL.\nDemonstrates the floor; CI gate section shows it failing at threshold 90.\n\nDepth comparison — barrel pattern now provably affects discovery:\nutils/vendor.ts re-exports lodash; format.ts imports locally from vendor.\n--depth direct skips re-exports → lodash absent from resolvedPackages.\n--depth local-graph follows the chain → lodash surfaces. Confirmed in\nbash demo.sh --depth.\n\nCI gate demo — demo.sh --ci-gate runs federation-gate.ts against scenarios\n1 (PASS), 2 (FAIL: catalog 60, checkout 84), and 4 (FAIL: all CRITICAL).\nAdded tsconfig.json so ts-node resolves __dirname via CommonJS module mode.","tree":{"sha":"cbfebf48ee98a51241dbc1bbaa537e8d81ed0909","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/mf-storefront-demo/git/trees/cbfebf48ee98a51241dbc1bbaa537e8d81ed0909"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/mf-storefront-demo/git/commits/25193667f752a023b691b78490b664768c6edeba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51998458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zvitaly7","id":51998458,"login":"zvitaly7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk4NDU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/received_events","r