io API sound system with SFX/BGM and volume controls\n- Fix iOS fullscreen with pseudo-fullscreen fallback\n- Replace coin shop with pick-1-of-3 card upgrade system (4 rarity tiers)\n- Add 3 pattern-based bosses every 5 levels (construction, sniper, drone swarm)\n- Add relic drops from bosses as run-defining modifiers\n- Add light meta progression (permanent upgrades in localStorage)\n- Add 4 biomes (city, beach, night, festival) with unique visuals and mechanics\n- Add combo scoring system (consecutive hits build multiplier)\n- Add seeded RNG and daily challenge mode\n- Extract game systems into modular subsystem files","tree":{"sha":"be8c8f1b5d683dc847ef63ddc7462ac8df057e76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xSolstice1/802Collections/git/trees/be8c8f1b5d683dc847ef63ddc7462ac8df057e76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xSolstice1/802Collections/git/commits/f37cfd07ea4958deb617cf21fef7408384859c5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117270763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/xSolstice1","id":117270763,"login":"xSolstice1","node_id":"U_kgDOBv1o6w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xSolstice1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h