s","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","node_id":"U_kgDOEDVKfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commit/e7aab71d5d8fcb7007cd07b9050f53f74ebf4c9f","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uHttoAKGU3YWFiNzFkNWQ4ZmNiNzAwN2NkMDdiOTA1MGY1M2Y3NGViZjRjOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commit/6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02","sha":"6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02"}],"sha":"e7aab71d5d8fcb7007cd07b9050f53f74ebf4c9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/e7aab71d5d8fcb7007cd07b9050f53f74ebf4c9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271927933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","node_id":"U_kgDOEDVKfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:24:00Z","email":"christianpeh966@gmail.com","name":"chrisfusion"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:24:00Z","email":"christianpeh966@gmail.com","name":"chrisfusion"},"message":"0.10.43: fix rolled-back steps rendering as failures\n\nWizardRunDetailPage.vue''s step progress list mapped RolledBack to the\nsame visual state as Failed/RollbackFailed -- a successfully,\nintentionally rolled-back run showed every step in red with the error\nicon, indistinguishable from a genuine failure. RolledBack now gets its\nown neutral/muted state (mdi-undo-variant icon, muted text) instead.\n\nFound during a full cross-wizard smoke test (all three wizards end to\nend, plus the Wizard Runs list/detail Retry/Roll Back/Delete actions,\neach verified against real cluster state via kubectl, not just the UI).\nRe-verified live after the fix: a rolled-back run''s steps now render\nwith the muted undo icon instead of the red error one.","tree":{"sha":"2052549aa89c11c1308e5c9543c6baf8f1d27cb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/git/trees/2052549aa89c11c1308e5c9543c6baf8f1d27cb5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/git/commits/6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271927933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","node_id":"U_kgDOEDVKfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commit/6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uHttoAKDZlZTZhMjlkNDM2MmZmNTBjMjhkOGI2MGNmYTIxZGE5N2U1MWJmMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commit/c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920","sha":"c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920"}],"sha":"6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/6ee6a29d4362ff50c28d8b60cfa21da97e51bf02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271927933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","node_id":"U_kgDOEDVKfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:46:58Z","email":"christianpeh966@gmail.com","name":"chrisfusion"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:46:58Z","email":"christianpeh966@gmail.com","name":"chrisfusion"},"message":"0.10.42: Wizard Runs monitoring page\n\nAdds a \"Wizard Runs\" monitoring feature, closing the gap where\nnavigating away from a run mid-provisioning lost track of it entirely:\nits state now lives at a URL, not component memory.\n\nWizardRunPage.vue is renamed to WizardCreatePage.vue and reduced to the\nSetup step only -- on success it now redirects to /wizards/runs/:name\ninstead of handling Provisioning/Done itself. New\nWizardRunDetailPage.vue is the one place that polls and renders a run''s\nprogress (moved from the old page''s steps 2/3, not duplicated), used\nboth right after creation and when revisiting a run later. New\nWizardRunsPage.vue (/wizards/runs) lists every run with stats-by-phase\nand a filterable table. Both pages get Retry/Roll Back/Delete actions,\ngated by the matching wizard:runs:* permission, using the repo''s\nstandard $q.dialog() confirm pattern. New \"Runs\" nav group and a \"View\nRuns\" header action on the wizards landing page.\n\nVerified end-to-end in a headed, visible browser: created a run,\nnavigated away mid-provisioning, found it again via /wizards/runs,\nclicked through, and confirmed it resumed showing the same live\nprogress through to Ready. Cleaned up test runs, zero leftover\nresources.","tree":{"sha":"e73bfafc053363c6513f32fb90938e27476764ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/git/trees/e73bfafc053363c6513f32fb90938e27476764ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/git/commits/c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271927933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","node_id":"U_kgDOEDVKfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commit/c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uHttoAKGM4ODNlZTJlNGJkZjU3NjEzZjliZGI1MGJiMmFlMTM5YTU0MTQ5MjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commit/841934a1d44ee1beaccd807d8bd41e285eca444d","sha":"841934a1d44ee1beaccd807d8bd41e285eca444d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/841934a1d44ee1beaccd807d8bd41e285eca444d"}],"sha":"c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/c883ee2e4bdf57613f9bdb50bb2ae139a5414920"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271927933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","node_id":"U_kgDOEDVKfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/commits/841934a1d44ee1beaccd807d8bd41e285eca444d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:18:04Z","email":"christianpeh966@gmail.com","name":"chrisfusion"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T17:18:04Z","email":"christianpeh966@gmail.com","name":"chrisfusion"},"message":"0.10.41: migrate Git -> Python Job onto the generic wizard page\n\nGit -> Python Job is the last of the three shortcut wizards to move off\nclient-side orchestration onto WizardRunPage.vue\n(/wizards/run/python-git-job/create), backed by fusion-wizard''s updated\npython-git-job WizardDefinition (objectList entrypoints, per-entry\ntype/schedule).\n\nNew objectRows widget (wizardDisplayMeta.ts: WizardRowField, rowFields,\nkeyPlaceholder) -- the UI counterpart of an objectList parameter: a\nrepeatable per-entry row editor (add-row text input + declared\nsub-fields, e.g. a select type toggle and a conditionally-shown\nCronPicker), reusing the original wizard''s entry-add/entry-row/\nkind-toggle CSS verbatim.\n\nThe old GitPythonJobWizardPage.vue and its route are removed;\nuseGitAppProvisioning.ts is no longer imported by any wizard (kept in\nplace per fusion-wizard''s own CLAUDE.md note, not deleted).\nsrc/pages/wizards/CLAUDE.md rewritten -- the generic, backend-driven\npattern is now the only one any current wizard uses.\n\nVerified end-to-end in a real, visible (headed) browser: filled the\nform including adding two entrypoints via the new row editor (one\nManual, one switched to Cron with a schedule), submitted, reached\nReady with both View Trigger links. Confirmed via kubectl that the two\nresulting WeaveTriggers have independently correct type/schedule and\nmanaged-by labels, then deleted the run and confirmed zero leftover\nresources.\n\nA real UX gap surfaced while testing -- WizardRunPage.vue only polls a\nrun while mounted, so navigating away loses track of an in-progress\nrun''s progress -- is written up in PLAN_fusion_wizard.md, not yet\ndecided/scoped.","tree":{"sha":"5645af9b9b5602e25976abea9fc8466719f7648d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/git/trees/5645af9b9b5602e25976abea9fc8466719f7648d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisfusion/fusion-spectra/git/commits/841934a1d44ee1beaccd807d8bd41e285eca444d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/271927933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisfusion/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisfusion","id":271927933,"login":"chrisfusion","no