ub.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/bc4dfb3ce9df6be41b52662c5db3988d6cd6ea8e","sha":"bc4dfb3ce9df6be41b52662c5db3988d6cd6ea8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/bc4dfb3ce9df6be41b52662c5db3988d6cd6ea8e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e","sha":"e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e"}],"sha":"e1624b46aff36eb928492219f39205dc7dae9353","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e1624b46aff36eb928492219f39205dc7dae9353"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T13:09:53Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T13:09:53Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"fix(chat): immutable setMessages updates so React 19 strict mode stops doubling\n\nThe existing setMessages callbacks mutated the previous state directly\n(`last.content += event.text`, `last.agentPageTitle = ...`, etc.). React\n19''s dev strict mode runs reducer-style updaters twice to detect impurity,\nso each `text` event was being applied twice — assistant messages rendered\nwith their content concatenated to itself.\n\nReplace all four mutating updates (text, agent_selected, done, error)\nwith immutable {...last, ...} returns. Now strict-mode double invocation\nproduces the same result as a single call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6cfafd58ad5c65188d146ba45f504592e03ed36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/a6cfafd58ad5c65188d146ba45f504592e03ed36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGU4NTg4Njk3OGIzNTUwODA2YTk5NTgzYTQ2NzlhYzlhN2ZjZDI4MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246","sha":"e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246"}],"sha":"e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e85886978b3550806a99583a4679ac9a7fcd281e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T13:06:28Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T13:06:28Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"feat(chat): collapsible brain panel on /chat — watch the mind react in-place\n\nAdd BrainPanel: a right-rail collapsible panel that wraps BrainCanvas. Open\nstate persists in localStorage (key: mentisphere:chat-brain-panel-open).\nLayout fetch and ambient SSE subscription happen lazily on first open, so\nusers who never expand it pay zero cost.\n\nWire Chat.tsx to drive the activation state:\n- Reset activated set when sending a new message.\n- Handle the new SSE events (thinking / activated / selected) emitted by\n  /api/chat alongside the existing agent_selected/text/done flow.\n- Animate a traveling-dot phase while isStreaming is true so active edges\n  in the panel show \"thought\" moving through the graph.\n- Fade the lit state 6s after `done`.\n\nThe wiring matches the /pulse page choreography exactly; the panel is\njust a smaller, in-place view of the same mind reacting to YOUR question\nwhile you''re chatting your domain expert.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"109ac4b4b85e51f0d749cd63784ae8ea73fe160b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/109ac4b4b85e51f0d749cd63784ae8ea73fe160b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGU3Yjg0MWI5ZmUzODMzMjUyYzE3NzAyZmEzMGE5ZjIwMzU2MWMyNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d","sha":"7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d"}],"sha":"e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/e7b841b9fe3833252c17702fa30a9f203561c246"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T12:05:26Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T12:05:26Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"feat(dev): unified-origin local dev — Next.js proxies MW + parametric MW host port\n\nTwo ergonomics changes for running /pulse alongside MediaWiki locally:\n\n1. docker-compose.yml: parameterize MW host port via ${MEDIAWIKI_HOST_PORT:-8080}\n   so anyone with a conflict on 8080 can override (e.g., MEDIAWIKI_HOST_PORT=8081).\n2. chat-service/next.config.ts: when MEDIAWIKI_PROXY_URL is set, rewrite MW\n   paths (/wiki, /index.php, /api.php, /load.php, /rest.php, /skins, /resources,\n   /images, /extensions) through chat-service. Lets developers visit MW and\n   /pulse on the same origin (e.g., http://localhost:3001), so the MW session\n   cookie reaches /api/chat — without which the chat-with-the-brain flow 401s.\n\nProduction unchanged — both vars default to off, nginx still handles routing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e812b356988f350691f8ba8b9fceacb00ecc8428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/e812b356988f350691f8ba8b9fceacb00ecc8428"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKDdlMGQxMjBiZGE2NTliNTA4MDE4YzhmYmMwMjRkYWZhMGFiYmFjOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31","sha":"f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31"}],"sha":"7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/7e0d120bda659b508018c8fbc024dafa0abbac9d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:59:08Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:59:08Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"feat(nginx): route /pulse and /brain.png to chat-service\n\nThe /pulse page is a chat-service route. Without an explicit nginx\nlocation block it would fall through to the catch-all `/` proxy that\nsends traffic to MediaWiki, which doesn''t know about /pulse. Add:\n\n- /pulse → chat-service/pulse\n- /brain.png → chat-service/brain.png (1-day cache, since the asset is\n  generated once via gpt-image and rarely changes).\n\n/api/* and /_next/* are already routed to chat-service, so /api/pulse/*\nand Next.js client chunks already work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80ed4a6e724453498bddc6246c73604dec7b4b6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/80ed4a6e724453498bddc6246c73604dec7b4b6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGY1MWZmYzUyYjRkMWFkM2MyNDQ5YTBmY2E0YzZiMTA5OTZmYTRhMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d","sha":"abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d"}],"sha":"f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/f51ffc52b4d1ad3c2449a0fca4c6b10996fa4a31"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:58:13Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:58:13Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"feat(pulse): hover tooltip + click-to-open on nodes\n\nNodeLayer:\n- Set eventMode=\"static\" + cursor=\"pointer\" so each node responds to mouse.\n- Draw an invisible hit ring at max(radius+6, 10) so small nodes are still\n  easy to hover.\n- Forward onPointerOver/Out and onPointerTap up via onNodeHover/onNodeClick\n  callback props.\n\nBrainCanvas:\n- Track hoveredTitle and live mouse position relative to the canvas.\n- Render a small monospace tooltip near the cursor showing the page title.\n- Flip the tooltip to the left of the cursor when near the right edge.\n- onNodeClick opens /wiki/<encoded title> in a new tab.\n\nThis was originally listed as a v1 stretch in the spec; user requested it\nduring the local smoke test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"727b9dba970010c807d45789a04170c2682a247b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/727b9dba970010c807d45789a04170c2682a247b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGFiZDJhMmRmN2VmNzkxODM1MDBjMjMwMTNhNGRhMTY3MmRiMWY0NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd","sha":"f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd"}],"sha":"abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/abd2a2df7ef79183500c23013a4da1672db1f46d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:55:33Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:55:33Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"fix(pulse): unlock dock + show error when /api/chat returns non-SSE\n\nThe previous submitQuestion silently dropped non-200 responses from\n/api/chat (auth failures return JSON, not SSE). The reader loop processed\nzero events and exited, leaving pending=true forever — dock stuck on\n\"Thinking…\".\n\nNow we:\n- Catch fetch network errors and reset pending.\n- On non-OK status, parse the JSON error, show it in the ResponseCard\n  (with a friendlier message for 401), and reset pending.\n- Handle the new SSE `error` event type from /api/chat.\n- Defensively reset pending if the stream ends without a `done` event.\n\nFound while smoke-testing /pulse against a stack with no MW auth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92bbd6d2346d65eb5ab917ac7e236c59e06a1eca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/92bbd6d2346d65eb5ab917ac7e236c59e06a1eca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGY0ZjJkMWQyODQwOGMxMjllNjZmYWU1ZWVlODJkY2EzZTFjZjM4YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195","sha":"79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195"}],"sha":"f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/f4f2d1d28408c129e66fae5eee82dca3e1cf38bd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:19:09Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T11:19:09Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"fix(pulse): close-over cleanup fn so SSE subscribers don''t leak on disconnect\n\nInside a ReadableStream''s `cancel` callback, `this` references the source\nobject — not the controller. The previous code stashed the cleanup on the\ncontroller and tried to read it via `this`, so cleanup never ran on client\ndisconnect: every disconnected client left behind a pgListener subscriber\nand a heartbeat interval. Move the cleanup fn into a closed-over\n`let cleanup` shared between `start` and `cancel`.\n\nFound in final code review.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"147a30747477eae496f1a5f87b7273ab39c20fca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/147a30747477eae496f1a5f87b7273ab39c20fca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKDc5ZDI0MTcxM2ZjYjZhN2VjZDc2MmNmNGI5YTkzMDFlNDg2ZTUxOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/4f443b4e2a0100ec5d2a8aee976388c8f76e648a","sha":"4f443b4e2a0100ec5d2a8aee976388c8f76e648a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/4f443b4e2a0100ec5d2a8aee976388c8f76e648a"}],"sha":"79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/79d241713fcb6a7ecd762cf4b9a9301e486e5195"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/4f443b4e2a0100ec5d2a8aee976388c8f76e648a/com