22:01Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"docs(pulse): apply plan-review fixes — sqlClient deps + drizzle alias removal\n\n- Fix dep graph: Tasks 14 and 16 import sqlClient (added by Task 9), so\n  they cannot run in parallel before Task 9 lands.\n- Drop the unnecessary `import { db as drizzle }` aliasing in Task 8 —\n  `db` already exposes `db.query.agentStats.findMany()`.\n- Add a comment in Task 16 explaining why the route emits both `selected`\n  and `agent_selected` for the same agent (legacy /chat compat).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd383ae1d21113317539afb44ec2950accf2026c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/fd383ae1d21113317539afb44ec2950accf2026c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/4bf5f4ce5e53410bf34935176fcaec9c6c900d6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/4bf5f4ce5e53410bf34935176fcaec9c6c900d6d","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKDRiZjVmNGNlNWU1MzQxMGJmMzQ5MzUxNzZmY2FlYzljNmM5MDBkNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851","sha":"9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851"}],"sha":"4bf5f4ce5e53410bf34935176fcaec9c6c900d6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/4bf5f4ce5e53410bf34935176fcaec9c6c900d6d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:17:11Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:17:11Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"docs(pulse): implementation plan (draft, for review)\n\n26-task plan covering deps install, vitest setup, pure-lib TDD (brainMask,\nedgeBuilder, layoutBuilder), API endpoints (layout cache, activity SSE\nfanout), graph state additions, /api/chat refactor to graph.stream with\nactivation events + ephemeral surface=pulse mode, gpt-image asset + mask\ntrace, Pixi frontend (BrainCanvas, NodeLayer, EdgeLayer, ChatDock,\nResponseCard), and Playwright smoke. Includes a dependency graph for\nparallel execution.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44e95014cbf96006d7e0c77c2b998a128cbae42e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/44e95014cbf96006d7e0c77c2b998a128cbae42e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKDkzNTk2ODhjMDM1MjBkZTg1ZTE2OTQ2NzE3NmMzOGQxZWQ1NTQ4NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032","sha":"84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032"}],"sha":"9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/9359688c03520de85e169467176c38d1ed554851"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:08:21Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:08:21Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"docs(pulse): apply review advisories — rate scope + streamMode\n\n- Note that the existing rate endpoint only accepts session-based messages\n  (widget ratings), so the \"helpful rating glow\" signal fires for widget\n  ratings only in v1.\n- Specify graph.stream({ streamMode: ''updates'' }) as the streaming primitive\n  and enumerate the per-node-update → SSE-event mapping the route applies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35cbde2a80d1129c4661a2e58515b72c8f0a5b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/35cbde2a80d1129c4661a2e58515b72c8f0a5b5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKDg0ZGFhYzNhODg4ODU3NzBkNzIyZGEyZTEwNjY0MThmZmFlYjEwMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6","sha":"51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6"}],"sha":"84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/84daac3a88885770d722da2e1066418ffaeb1032"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:06:02Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:06:02Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"docs(pulse): revise spec after first review\n\nAddress reviewer findings about misalignment with actual /api/chat code:\n- Add explicit \"Required graph state additions\" for topAgentCandidates and\n  knowledgePageTitles (router and agent nodes already compute these locally\n  but discard them).\n- Drop per-token SSE in v1; keep the existing single-text event. Document\n  per-token streaming as a separate refactor.\n- Fix layout version computation to use created_at on knowledge_embeddings\n  (no updated_at column there).\n- Name NOTIFY emission points (chat route, rate route) on a single\n  pulse_activity channel.\n- Tighten ephemeral mode contract: zod rejects conversationId when\n  surface=pulse; route emits no conversation event in that case.\n- Document route handler refactor from graph.invoke to streamEvents.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8210444e155f52ce826625a965241afd01edfd59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/8210444e155f52ce826625a965241afd01edfd59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKDUxNTkzOTA3ZDZiZTA1M2FiMDI1ZWMwMzY2MGNhMDFhNTkwYzQ4ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/a4bef60a8acf0decef1d25aa1b03e3759ac30a75","sha":"a4bef60a8acf0decef1d25aa1b03e3759ac30a75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/a4bef60a8acf0decef1d25aa1b03e3759ac30a75"}],"sha":"51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/51593907d6be053ab025ec03660ca01a590c48e6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/a4bef60a8acf0decef1d25aa1b03e3759ac30a75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-10T10:01: