repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/bed611048d501a69ad8015024ca96530ab6fc1f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:39:31Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:39:31Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"refactor(mw): read secrets + server URL from env vars\n\nMove $wgServer, $wgDBpassword, $wgSecretKey, $wgUpgradeKey out of\nLocalSettings.php and into env vars (with dev fallbacks). Compose\npasses MEDIAWIKI_SERVER, MEDIAWIKI_UPGRADE_KEY (and the existing\nMEDIAWIKI_DB_PASSWORD/SECRET_KEY) into the MW container.\n\nLocalSettings.php and docker-compose.yml are now safe to deploy via\nthe workflow — prod-specific values live in /opt/mentisphere/.env\nand /opt/mentisphere/docker-compose.override.yml (cert mount + 443\nport), both gitignored and rsync-excluded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"faa4d6b0e2b199c9052c1e98ec5a3c1141ae9fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/faa4d6b0e2b199c9052c1e98ec5a3c1141ae9fa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/bed611048d501a69ad8015024ca96530ab6fc1f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/bed611048d501a69ad8015024ca96530ab6fc1f4","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGJlZDYxMTA0OGQ1MDFhNjlhZDgwMTUwMjRjYTk2NTMwYWI2ZmMxZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c","sha":"fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c"}],"sha":"bed611048d501a69ad8015024ca96530ab6fc1f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/bed611048d501a69ad8015024ca96530ab6fc1f4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:20:03Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T20:20:03Z","email":"francesco.villano@msccruises.com","name":"fvillano"},"message":"ci(deploy): exclude server-managed dirs from rsync\n\nThe previous workflow used --delete-after and synced mediawiki/skins/\n+ mediawiki/extensions/ — but most of those are 3rd-party files only\npresent on the server, not in git. The deploy wiped them, breaking MW.\n\nDrop --delete-after, and explicitly exclude:\n- docker-compose.yml (prod has cert mounts + 443 port not in repo)\n- mediawiki/skins/ (Citizen skin, not tracked)\n- third-party extensions (Cargo, PageForms, etc.)\n\nOnly MentiSphereChat (our custom extension) is deployed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9dc8f80db0374bc49d327b91dd980c11fcebba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/trees/f9dc8f80db0374bc49d327b91dd980c11fcebba3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/git/commits/fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c","node_id":"C_kwDOR4uOdNoAKGZjM2M3Y2M3ZGIzZWZhZTlhODI1OWJhMWU2OGU4Y2NjZTEyZDVhM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/franzvill/mentisphere/commit/38210b2a2fcc6fe25d12d618f9debdd26df5f806","sha":"38210b2a2fcc6fe25d12d618f9debdd26df5f806","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/38210b2a2fcc6fe25d12d618f9debdd26df5f806"}],"sha":"fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d5a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/franzvill/mentisphere/commits/fc3c7cc7db3efae9a8259ba1e68e8ccce12d