//api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commits/98423ab77e78172c6f87da237d725f195e067986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:48:33Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:48:33Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"message":"feat(dashboard): shift-ended cards + history snapshot-on-connect\n\nLineCard renders an ENDED badge and dimmed styling on the terminal snapshot\n(windowState CLOSED, explicit flag — never inferred from hoursRemaining);\nALARM stays dominant. On connect the dashboard seeds line cards from the new\nGET /api/history/windows/latest (latest persisted window per line, Mongo\naggregation) via a SHIFT_AGGREGATE_SNAPSHOT action that fills gaps but never\noverwrites live STOMP data, so reconnecting browsers aren''t blank until the\nnext change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YamhsX35fX9nGh1wCtJfCN","tree":{"sha":"937f3ef7705a2393dd204ff08219b4d78aef327e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/937f3ef7705a2393dd204ff08219b4d78aef327e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/commits/98423ab77e78172c6f87da237d725f195e067986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11652811?v=4","events_ur