811,"login":"rvasqz86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUyODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commits/05d8632a8f0fe956e25852afac7417b862b4e71f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T10:40:53Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T10:40:53Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"message":"feat(alarm-service): MongoDB shift-history sink + REST query API\n\nHistorical store for shift aggregates: history-sink consumer group\n(read_committed, earliest for backfill) upserts one document per shift window\nkeyed by deterministic id lineId:windowStartMillis; status OPEN/CLOSED mirrors\nthe aggregate''s windowState terminal flag. Indexes on (lineId, windowStart),\nwindowStart, (status, windowEnd).\n\nGET /api/history/{lineId}/windows?from=&to= and /latest serve trend queries\nand dashboard snapshot-on-connect. windowState also exposed on the\n/topic/shift-aggregates STOMP payload. HISTORY_ENABLED toggle ties the sink,\nendpoints, and Mongo health indicator together; mongodb service added to both\ncompose files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YamhsX35fX9nGh1wCtJfCN","tree":{"sha":"2e0cc319a68b63bf6410fd4e94d6c85138c194d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/2e0cc319a68b63bf6410fd4e94d6c85138c194d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-s