url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86","id":11652811,"login":"rvasqz86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUyODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commits/2e2f1edfd79787243fa57191a836387e47a2a2a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T10:40:53Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T10:40:53Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"message":"feat(stream-processor): shift-windowing hardening + windowState terminal flag\n\nDurability/closure hardening (per 2026-06-30 design spec): persistent bounded\npre-shift buffer (PreShiftBuffer/BufferedMesEvent stores, drop-oldest cap),\nhybrid time-based closure (event-time close + wall-clock punctuator sharing\nforceCloseShift), nearest-occurrence schedule anchoring, ShiftProcessorConfig\ntunables with env overrides.\n\nPlus new: explicit windowState OPEN/CLOSED lifecycle flag on ShiftAggregate\n(schema default OPEN) set by the processor on open and by every close path —\ndownstream consumers key off this instead of inferring closure from\nhoursRemaining == 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YamhsX35fX9nGh1wCtJfCN","tree":{"sha":"e809d0c100103e924ad100e34fd41c