1T01:21:41Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"message":"feat(coolify): add production eventcatalog with static build + nginx\n\nReplace Astro dev server (2GB+ RAM, crashes) with a static production\nbuild served by nginx (128MB RAM). Multi-stage Dockerfile: Node build\nstage with NODE_OPTIONS=--max_old_space_size=8196 (per EventCatalog\ndocs), then nginx:alpine serves the static dist/ output on port 80.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a52a90cec2115024e961c43b2bf347a765558833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/a52a90cec2115024e961c43b2bf347a765558833"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/commits/b579c78ed46c4daa4b5767d2f9ba2d201d626019","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11652811?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86","id":11652811,"login":"rvasqz86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUyODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commit/b579c78ed46c4daa4b5767d2f9ba2d201d626