quires 2GB+ RAM and crashes\nwith \"The service was stopped\" at any lower limit. Eventcatalog is\nsupplementary docs, not core functionality — remove it from the\nCoolify stack to save ~1GB RAM for the services that matter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2c386689ff8dbfc8d1deffd4295a06139b37bee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/d2c386689ff8dbfc8d1deffd4295a06139b37bee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/commits/75bdcf11a9fdea4da870421409db736c66740006","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11652811?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86","id":11652811,"login":"rvasqz86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUyODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commit/75bdcf11a9fdea4da870421409db736c66740006","node_id":"C_kwDOR40A_9oAKDc1YmRjZjExYTlmZGVhNGRhODcwNDIxNDA5ZGI3MzZjNjY3NDAwMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commit/2589d733cb0971