r_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commits/d0ebbce4c59ed13925d63f48c646144d87c6d91c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T01:47:16Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T01:47:16Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"message":"refactor: consolidate simulators into alarm-service, use KafkaTemplate, fix thread safety\n\n- Delete redundant DataSimulator from stream-processor (raw KafkaProducer, standalone main())\n- Refactor SimulatorService to inject KafkaTemplate<String, Object> via constructor instead of creating a raw KafkaProducer\n- Remove bootstrapServers/@Value fields, createProducer(), and generic send() helper\n- Replace all producer.send() calls with kafkaTemplate.send() and producer.flush() with kafkaTemplate.flush()\n- Remove KafkaProducer parameter from all private simulation methods\n- Fix thread safety: use CopyOnWriteArrayList for runLog in runAsync()\n- Add @EnableAsync to AlarmServiceApp alongside @EnableScheduling\n- Add spring.kafka.producer config (StringSerializer + KafkaAvroSerializer) to application.yml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a406ec0816f282469ac940d2b106b80d02494c37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/a406ec0816f282469ac940d2b106b80d02494c37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/commits/d0ebbce4c59ed13925d63f48c646144d87c6d91c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11652811?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/following{/ot