E runtime) and\nlightweight Node Dockerfile for dashboard-ui. Add KafkaToStompIntegrationTest\nthat boots the full Spring context with EmbeddedKafka and mock Schema Registry,\nproduces Avro records to all 5 topics, and verifies WebSocketEventPublisher\nroutes them to the correct STOMP destinations. Fix logback version mismatch\n(classic 1.5.12 vs core 1.5.18) that prevented Spring Boot context startup\nin tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f2fc6c821f33e31ec20d828d4091a040edb9674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/3f2fc6c821f33e31ec20d828d4091a040edb9674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/commits/e7fa459ea7fd90e3a6a93ca787e80da584671c75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11652811?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86","id":11652811,"login":"rvasqz86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUyODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commit/e7fa459ea7fd90e3a6a93ca787e80da584671c75","n