//api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rvasqz86","id":11652811,"login":"rvasqz86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjUyODEx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rvasqz86","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/commits/c32c824f6478e891509ca2246c5407a9f188c75c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T01:48:07Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T01:48:07Z","email":"rvasqz86@gmail.com","name":"rvasqz86"},"message":"feat: add REST API for alarm rules, reason codes, and alarm state\n\nImplements Task 5 — Spring Boot REST endpoints in alarm-service:\n- AlarmRuleController: CRUD for alarm rules, writes to compacted alarm-rules topic\n- ReasonCodeActionController: CRUD for reason-code actions, writes to reason-code-actions topic\n- AlarmStateController: read-only query of alarm-state store via Interactive Queries\n- KafkaProducerConfig: KafkaTemplate beans with Avro serializers for both entity types\n- AlarmRuleRequest / ReasonCodeActionRequest: request DTOs (no ruleId on create)\n\nAvro objects are projected to plain Maps for REST responses to avoid Jackson/Avro serialization conflicts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dd74338156676fb704e3f42d22b878acc37f387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufacturing-mes-streaming-aggregate/git/trees/0dd74338156676fb704e3f42d22b878acc37f387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rvasqz86/manufact