df092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/commits/c12e1b82468664705030e874aebfaf80e73df092"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1847934?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kibertoad","id":1847934,"login":"kibertoad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDc5MzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kibertoad","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/commits/5cf209f4f66a1f936c18e071db22dfe42d4627c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:00:24Z","email":"iselwin@gmail.com","name":"Igor Savin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T15:00:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(angular): add @angular-router-modules/core (PR-A20) (#78)\n\n* feat(angular): add @angular-router-modules/core (PR-A20)\n\nNew packages/angular-router-core (@angular-router-modules/core, 0.1.0), the\nfirst package of the angular-router family (Phase A2) and the Angular analog\nof @react-router-modules/core and @modular-vue/core.\n\nPlain TS on the repo''s rolldown pipeline (no @Component code, per AD3):\n\n- types.ts: ModuleDescriptor re-narrows createRoutes to () => Route | Route[]\n  (Angular Router''s Route), plus LazyModuleDescriptor and the bivariant\n  AnyModuleDescriptor<TNavItem> shorthand; re-exports shared core types.\n- define-module.ts / define-slots.ts: identity inference helper and the\n  headless-module shorthand, mirroring the React/Vue bodies.\n- route-data.ts: ModuleRouteData<TZones>, the typed convention for carrying\n  zone components and per-route statics on a route''s data (the Vue route-meta\n  / React handle analog); applied per-route with satisfies since Angular''s\n  Route[''data''] is a single non-augmentable Data type.\n- index.ts: re-exports detection helpers from @modular-frontend/core and the\n  shared-injector context + scoped store from @modular-angular/angular, the\n  same shape @modular-vue/core re-exports from @modular-vue/vue.\n\nTests port the Vue core inventory case-for-case: 12 tests across\ndefine-module.test-d.ts, route-data.test-d.ts, and define-slots.test.ts.\nPackage test / typecheck / build all pass; @angular/core, @angular/router,\n@modular-frontend/core, @modular-angular/angular stay external.\n\nAll workspace @angular/* resolutions aligned to 22.0.7 in the lockfile so the\ntwo Angular packages share one patch; the existing @modular-angular/angular\nranges are unchanged and its zoneless TestBed suite still passes.\n\nUpdates docs/angular-support-tracker.md (status board, delivery notes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BJ9Dw1V4ido7JG3xpqnGXE\n\n* test(angular-router-core): add index re-export smoke test\n\nPort the runtime re-export barrel test from @modular-vue/core''s\nindex.test.ts. The package''s index.ts re-exports runtime values from\n@modular-angular/angular (SHARED_DEPENDENCIES, provideSharedDependencies,\ncreateSharedInjectors, createScopedStore) and detection helpers from\n@modular-frontend/core, but the prior suite exercised only type-level\nassertions plus the local defineSlots — a broken barrel would not have\nbeen caught in this package. This asserts the wiring resolves at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PTxphStVSC3Ljd65pG2aTT\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19ac2eceb38af78e96872bd1e0296963f03ac494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/git/trees/19ac2eceb38af78e96872bd1e0296963f03ac494"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/git/commits/5cf209f4f66a1f936c18e071db22dfe42d4627c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 19ac2eceb38af78e96872bd1e0296963f03ac494\nparent 46eb54d1de6c3e60a230853039fed67f6e39b814\nauthor Igor Savin <iselwin@gmail.com> 1784300424 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784300424 +0200\n\nfeat(angular): add @angular-router-modules/core (PR-A20) (#78)\n\n* feat(angular): add @angular-router-modules/core (PR-A20)\n\nNew packages/angular-router-core (@angular-router-modules/core, 0.1.0), the\nfirst package of the angular-router family (Phase A2) and the Angular analog\nof @react-router-modules/core and @modular-vue/core.\n\nPlain TS on the repo''s rolldown pipeline (no @Component code, per AD3):\n\n- types.ts: ModuleDescriptor re-narrows createRoutes to () => Route | Route[]\n  (Angular Router''s Route), plus LazyModuleDescriptor and the bivariant\n  AnyModuleDescriptor<TNavItem> shorthand; re-exports shared core types.\n- define-module.ts / define-slots.ts: identity inference helper and the\n  headless-module shorthand, mirroring the React/Vue bodies.\n- route-data.ts: ModuleRouteData<TZones>, the typed convention for carrying\n  zone components and per-route statics on a route''s data (the Vue route-meta\n  / React handle analog); applied per-route with satisfies since Angular''s\n  Route[''data''] is a single non-augmentable Data type.\n- index.ts: re-exports detection helpers from @modular-frontend/core and the\n  shared-injector context + scoped store from @modular-angular/angular, the\n  same shape @modular-vue/core re-exports from @modular-vue/vue.\n\nTests port the Vue core inventory case-for-case: 12 tests across\ndefine-module.test-d.ts, route-data.test-d.ts, and define-slots.test.ts.\nPackage test / typecheck / build all pass; @angular/core, @angular/router,\n@modular-frontend/core, @modular-angular/angular stay external.\n\nAll workspace @angular/* resolutions aligned to 22.0.7 in the lockfile so the\ntwo Angular packages share one patch; the existing @modular-angular/angular\nranges are unchanged and its zoneless TestBed suite still passes.\n\nUpdates docs/angular-support-tracker.md (status board, delivery notes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BJ9Dw1V4ido7JG3xpqnGXE\n\n* test(angular-router-core): add index re-export smoke test\n\nPort the runtime re-export barrel test from @modular-vue/core''s\nindex.test.ts. The package''s index.ts re-exports runtime values from\n@modular-angular/angular (SHARED_DEPENDENCIES, provideSharedDependencies,\ncreateSharedInjectors, createScopedStore) and detection helpers from\n@modular-frontend/core, but the prior suite exercised only type-level\nassertions plus the local defineSlots — a broken barrel would not have\nbeen caught in this package. This asserts the wiring resolves at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PTxphStVSC3Ljd65pG2aTT\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWkOICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACuAQADwqMmI1/IMfS4t7Emq0HUb2\npeViEck/Jq1pILji5SU6XULSRkcyFHxajr46YK3SlkSgr15h+1nS4l4SrhomqwxJ\nD6XvKCKVWB0gj//5q3zeiOo/7QA/BXx2qCvDu1CrbTcs55qsdPu73SlnacJOfBiI\nT4QdgSyoEI+fuhcYaeO25onNSE1uHc/GzIHyzlqUEINtXWcMzPCsxkZ2YDinNdfn\n+HyGjdAjdTBndiBhnpGOFh/zZiys2g9eBsZSY2fZtSrR/M77S4XiT5er0bXALUPI\ngP/dkB6WpfsHLh6G2gYhbWu6mm7SW45nj703Iq1lMmPOo7Y5GyCUYDzKUlQfX5no\nugYABK6L8fxi1SHOXqhbTsbK4n8mISCW+aNew50T1nbkB4YIfUH0agn7i+9Pylry\n+PWiR+0