os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diogomiguel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diogomiguel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diogomiguel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/commits/62060fd95beb1214044bbe058927dd348d0d1b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:12:34Z","email":"diogo.silva@lokalise.com","name":"Diogo Silva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:12:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(journeys,core): add runtime.goForward + JourneyInstance.future redo stack (#40)\n\nInverse of `runtime.goBack`. `goBack` was destructive — it popped the\ncurrent step + rollback snapshot off the instance record and threw the\ndata away, so a shell wiring browser Forward to journey navigation had\nno way to redo the rewind. The URL would drift ahead of the runtime\nwith no recovery path beyond re-firing the original exit (which\nrequires the step component''s form data + side effects, neither of\nwhich the shell has).","tree":{"sha":"a3ae582da140fb6711486dfa62afe9e8abd31587","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/git/trees/a3ae582da140fb6711486dfa62afe9e8abd31587"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kibertoad/modular-react/git/commits/62060fd95beb1214044bbe058927dd348d0d1b3f","verification":{"payload":"tree a3ae582da140fb6711486dfa62afe9e8abd31587\nparent a97bfd7dd507c2f53f1f8a852f75f3e80e89621d\nauthor Diogo Silva <diogo.silva@lokalise.com> 1778839954 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778839954 +0100\n\nfeat(journeys,core): add runtime.goForward + JourneyInstance.future redo stack (#40)\n\nInverse of `runtime.goBack`. `goBack` was destructive — it popped the\ncurrent step + rollback snapshot off the instance record and threw the\ndata away, so a shell wiring browser Forward to journey navigation had\nno way to redo t